WEBVTT

1
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:52,885
Itu cuma kesalahpahaman.

2
00:00:55,054 --> 00:00:56,430
Orang tunanetra tak bisa...

3
00:00:57,134 --> 00:01:00,101
...benar-benar memahami
gagasan kecantikan.

4
00:01:01,894 --> 00:01:07,400
Tidak, orang tunanetra sepertiku,

5
00:01:08,567 --> 00:01:13,906
kami sering memikirkan gagasan orang...

6
00:01:13,989 --> 00:01:17,701
...tentang kecantikan.

7
00:01:18,285 --> 00:01:21,580
Aku menghabiskan bertahun-tahun
mencari kecantikan itu,

8
00:01:22,143 --> 00:01:25,709
berkeliling negara ini,
mengunjungi makam dan monumen,

9
00:01:25,793 --> 00:01:27,795
menyentuh dan menemukan kecantikan...

10
00:01:27,878 --> 00:01:31,549
...yang ditinggalkan para leluhur kita.

11
00:01:32,258 --> 00:01:34,718
Kau sudah mengalami banyak kesulitan.

12
00:01:34,802 --> 00:01:36,262
Tentu.

13
00:01:36,887 --> 00:01:39,723
Tapi ada sesuatu...

14
00:01:39,807 --> 00:01:41,308
...yang sangat ingin kutanyakan.

15
00:01:41,392 --> 00:01:43,811
Tanganmu sangat lembut.

16
00:01:43,894 --> 00:01:45,479
- Tanganku?
- Ya.

17
00:01:45,562 --> 00:01:48,315
Kukira orang yang mengukir...

18
00:01:48,430 --> 00:01:50,932
...memiliki tangan yang kapalan,
tapi tanganmu sangat halus.

19
00:01:50,984 --> 00:01:53,737
Apa kau merawatnya?

20
00:01:56,281 --> 00:01:59,410
Aku sangat merawat tanganku.

21
00:01:59,639 --> 00:02:00,640
Tangan ini...

22
00:02:01,495 --> 00:02:04,790
...seperti mata...

23
00:02:05,582 --> 00:02:06,667
...bagiku.

24
00:02:07,626 --> 00:02:10,462
Aku melihat dan merasakan
lewat tangan.

25
00:02:11,296 --> 00:02:13,632
Bagaimana dengan bekas luka itu?

26
00:02:14,049 --> 00:02:16,385
Oh, ini?

27
00:02:17,645 --> 00:02:19,263
Aku terluka saat kecil...

28
00:02:20,430 --> 00:02:23,976
Bagi kami,
mempelajari pekerjaan itu sulit.

29
00:02:24,726 --> 00:02:28,480
Orang biasa seperti kami
tak bisa membayangkan...

30
00:02:28,563 --> 00:02:30,607
...betapa sulitnya itu.

31
00:02:31,984 --> 00:02:35,946
Mari ganti topik.

32
00:02:37,447 --> 00:02:40,242
Kau seorang perajin ukir stempel...

33
00:02:40,325 --> 00:02:42,536
...sekaligus ayah tunggal...

34
00:02:42,619 --> 00:02:44,412
...untuk putramu, yang kini menjalankan...

35
00:02:44,573 --> 00:02:46,623
...Cheongpung Engraving.

36
00:02:46,790 --> 00:02:48,416
- Hm?
- Ya.

37
00:02:48,959 --> 00:02:51,211
Kurasa penonton akan penasaran...

38
00:02:51,294 --> 00:02:53,103
...tentang bagian kehidupan itu.

39
00:02:53,129 --> 00:02:54,840
Kenapa mereka penasaran soal itu?

40
00:02:54,923 --> 00:02:57,259
Membesarkan anak sendirian
sudah cukup sulit,

41
00:02:57,342 --> 00:03:02,764
apalagi sebagai orang tunanetra.

42
00:03:03,098 --> 00:03:04,015
Semua orang berusaha
membesarkan anak dengan baik,

43
00:03:04,099 --> 00:03:05,308
bahkan dalam kesulitan.

44
00:03:07,352 --> 00:03:09,125
Anak-anak bisa dibilang tumbuh sendiri...

45
00:03:09,860 --> 00:03:11,961
...jika kita biarkan.

46
00:03:12,107 --> 00:03:13,858
Anak-anak tak tumbuh sendiri,

47
00:03:13,942 --> 00:03:15,860
kau membesarkannya!

48
00:03:16,569 --> 00:03:20,031
Itu yang membuatku penasaran.

49
00:03:20,698 --> 00:03:26,704
Soal kesulitan dan pemikiranmu...

50
00:03:29,171 --> 00:03:30,792
Memang sulit.

51
00:03:32,308 --> 00:03:32,919
Ya.

52
00:03:34,065 --> 00:03:36,443
Apa gunanya terus meratapi kesulitan?

53
00:03:39,377 --> 00:03:41,678
Pelan-pelan saja.

54
00:03:42,929 --> 00:03:46,266
<i>Pukul 15.04.</i>

55
00:03:46,432 --> 00:03:48,643
Dong-hwan,
Ayah mau istirahat sebentar.

56
00:03:48,726 --> 00:03:50,103
Ayah, mereka sibuk.

57
00:03:50,186 --> 00:03:51,562
Maaf, sebentar.

58
00:03:51,646 --> 00:03:53,564
- Maaf.
- Kita harus lanjutkan...

59
00:03:53,648 --> 00:03:55,733
Maaf, aku tak sadar
waktu berlalu sangat cepat.

60
00:03:55,817 --> 00:03:56,984
- Itu sangat menarik.
- Maaf.

61
00:03:57,068 --> 00:03:59,445
Ayo istirahat sebentar, maaf.

62
00:03:59,529 --> 00:04:01,572
- Merokoklah, Ayah.
- Istirahat, Semuanya!

63
00:04:02,407 --> 00:04:04,242
Ini pintunya.

64
00:04:05,993 --> 00:04:08,621
PENGHARGAAN

65
00:04:11,791 --> 00:04:14,710
Dong-hwan, ayahmu sangat luar biasa.

66
00:04:16,420 --> 00:04:19,006
Dia jauh lebih baik
dari yang pantas kudapatkan.

67
00:04:19,540 --> 00:04:20,554
Lihat ini!

68
00:04:20,701 --> 00:04:22,635
Im Yeong-gyu adalah bukti...

69
00:04:22,718 --> 00:04:23,678
...bahwa keajaiban itu nyata.

70
00:04:24,887 --> 00:04:26,764
Judul luar biasa.

71
00:04:29,397 --> 00:04:30,393
Apa ini?

72
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,478
Oh, itu?

73
00:04:32,770 --> 00:04:34,689
Itu foto lama...

74
00:04:34,772 --> 00:04:37,984
...saat dia membuka kios ukirannya.

75
00:04:39,610 --> 00:04:41,946
Itu satu-satunya foto lama
yang kami punya.

76
00:04:42,947 --> 00:04:44,865
Kau sangat mirip dia.

77
00:04:45,533 --> 00:04:47,076
Ya,

78
00:04:47,660 --> 00:04:52,164
aku juga berpikir begitu, jadi dulu sekali,

79
00:04:52,248 --> 00:04:55,626
aku mengatakan aku sangat mirip dia.

80
00:04:55,709 --> 00:04:59,129
Apa katanya?
Dia senang mendengarnya?

81
00:05:00,923 --> 00:05:03,342
Dia berdiri tanpa bicara, berpikir.

82
00:05:05,010 --> 00:05:06,554
Kurasa...

83
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,932
...mungkin dia memikirkan...

84
00:05:10,015 --> 00:05:12,539
...gagasan kemiripan...

85
00:05:13,102 --> 00:05:17,231
...karena dia tak bisa melihat dari lahir.

86
00:05:19,191 --> 00:05:20,818
Benar.

87
00:05:21,443 --> 00:05:23,946
Dia bahkan
tak pernah melihat wajahnya.

88
00:05:24,655 --> 00:05:27,157
Aku tak pernah
memikirkannya seperti itu.

89
00:05:27,241 --> 00:05:28,972
Di mana kau menaruh asbak?

90
00:05:29,410 --> 00:05:30,911
Sini, berikan padaku.

91
00:05:30,994 --> 00:05:32,996
- Kau sudah cukup istirahat, Pak?
- Ya.

92
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:35,874
- Kita lanjutkan?
- Ya.

93
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:39,419
Ayo lanjutkan syuting!

94
00:05:39,503 --> 00:05:41,797
- Kamera.
- Sebentar.

95
00:05:42,923 --> 00:05:44,758
- Maaf.
- Tak apa.

96
00:05:44,842 --> 00:05:47,135
Sorot tangannya.

97
00:05:48,599 --> 00:05:49,268
Baik.

98
00:05:49,346 --> 00:05:50,264
Siap.

99
00:05:50,347 --> 00:05:52,683
Pelan-pelan saja.

100
00:06:03,694 --> 00:06:12,035
THE UGLY

101
00:06:32,013 --> 00:06:32,931
Ayah.

102
00:06:34,808 --> 00:06:37,143
- Sudah waktunya minum teh?
- Ya.

103
00:06:38,186 --> 00:06:39,104
Ini panas.

104
00:06:39,187 --> 00:06:40,313
Ya.

105
00:06:40,397 --> 00:06:41,940
Baik.

106
00:06:46,444 --> 00:06:48,238
Apa wawancaranya sulit?

107
00:06:50,970 --> 00:06:52,617
Mereka mengganggu Ayah berhari-hari,

108
00:06:52,700 --> 00:06:54,452
seolah-olah ini penting.

109
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:56,287
Segmen berita sebelumnya...

110
00:06:56,371 --> 00:06:57,789
...hanya butuh syuting setengah hari.

111
00:06:57,872 --> 00:07:02,335
Bersabarlah sedikit lagi.

112
00:07:03,128 --> 00:07:04,796
Ini publisitas bagus untuk studio,

113
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:07,215
dan tak mudah untuk masuk TV.

114
00:07:07,757 --> 00:07:09,467
Ayah tahu,

115
00:07:10,009 --> 00:07:13,304
jika ini bagus untukmu,
Ayah rasa tak apa.

116
00:07:14,764 --> 00:07:16,724
Tapi produser muda itu...

117
00:07:16,808 --> 00:07:18,226
...menyebalkan.

118
00:07:18,309 --> 00:07:20,561
Kenapa dia memperlakukan Ayah
seperti anak-anak?

119
00:07:20,645 --> 00:07:21,938
Selalu menyuruh Ayah,

120
00:07:22,021 --> 00:07:22,897
'Lakukan ini' atau 'Lakukan itu!'

121
00:07:22,981 --> 00:07:25,066
Semua produser seperti itu.

122
00:07:25,149 --> 00:07:26,985
Biarkan saja.

123
00:07:28,861 --> 00:07:29,904
Kau benar.

124
00:07:30,655 --> 00:07:32,615
Di usia Ayah, menghasilkan uang...

125
00:07:32,699 --> 00:07:34,283
Ayah bersyukur...

126
00:07:34,367 --> 00:07:35,993
...karena diakui.

127
00:07:37,203 --> 00:07:40,248
Kau tahu Gyu-Chil sangat iri pada Ayah?

128
00:07:42,625 --> 00:07:44,127
Pria itu bangkrut,

129
00:07:44,210 --> 00:07:46,428
tapi dia terus bepergian.

130
00:07:46,454 --> 00:07:48,965
Apa? Dia belum kembali
dari Asia Tenggara?

131
00:07:49,048 --> 00:07:49,966
Belum.

132
00:07:50,049 --> 00:07:51,988
Aku sangat kecewa.

133
00:07:52,510 --> 00:07:54,053
Dia bisa saja mengajak Ayah,

134
00:07:54,136 --> 00:07:55,346
kenapa dia pergi sendiri?

135
00:07:55,429 --> 00:07:58,099
Untuk apa? Ayah tak bisa melihat.

136
00:07:58,182 --> 00:08:00,101
Kalian sudah lama berteman,

137
00:08:00,184 --> 00:08:02,186
bepergian bersama
akan menyenangkan.

138
00:08:03,187 --> 00:08:04,730
Dia bukan teman Ayah.

139
00:08:07,066 --> 00:08:08,505
Jangan bicara sembarangan.

140
00:08:09,694 --> 00:08:11,904
Baiklah, ada telepon. Sebentar.

141
00:08:11,987 --> 00:08:13,030
Oke.

142
00:08:15,157 --> 00:08:15,804
Halo?

143
00:08:16,117 --> 00:08:18,119
<i>Apa ini Pak Im Dong-hwan?</i>

144
00:08:18,145 --> 00:08:19,041
Ya, siapa ini?

145
00:08:19,537 --> 00:08:21,580
<i>Ini Kantor Polisi Namil.</i>

146
00:08:22,665 --> 00:08:23,603
Kantor polisi?

147
00:08:23,916 --> 00:08:25,167
<i>Kami menelepon soal...</i>

148
00:08:25,251 --> 00:08:26,377
<i>...Jung Young-hee.</i>

149
00:08:27,253 --> 00:08:28,212
Siapa itu?

150
00:08:28,546 --> 00:08:29,922
<i>Kau tak kenal Jung Young-hee?</i>

151
00:08:31,006 --> 00:08:32,716
<i>Dia ibumu.</i>

152
00:08:39,265 --> 00:08:40,307
Apa?

153
00:09:11,046 --> 00:09:12,673
Katamu dia ibuku?

154
00:09:14,049 --> 00:09:15,759
Itu yang kami duga.

155
00:09:16,510 --> 00:09:19,367
Kami menemukan kartu identitas
dengan jasadnya.

156
00:09:19,851 --> 00:09:21,848
Jasadnya ditemukan
saat menggali gunung...

157
00:09:21,932 --> 00:09:23,809
...untuk lokasi konstruksi,

158
00:09:25,435 --> 00:09:27,562
dan kami menemukan
barang pribadinya.

159
00:09:28,105 --> 00:09:30,232
Dilihat dari kondisi jasadnya,

160
00:09:30,315 --> 00:09:32,401
sudah 40 tahun.

161
00:09:32,943 --> 00:09:34,986
Kondisi jasadnya membuat kami...

162
00:09:35,070 --> 00:09:37,572
...sulit menentukan penyebab kematian.

163
00:09:37,656 --> 00:09:40,742
Kami hanya tahu
dia meninggal 40 tahun lalu...

164
00:09:40,835 --> 00:09:42,452
...dan dikubur di gunung itu.

165
00:09:43,578 --> 00:09:47,332
Sulit memastikan
apakah itu kecelakaan atau bukan,

166
00:09:48,083 --> 00:09:50,043
tetapi dilihat dari cara jasad itu dikubur,

167
00:09:51,002 --> 00:09:52,796
ada kemungkinan
terjadi tindak kejahatan.

168
00:09:54,005 --> 00:09:55,632
Meski begitu, batas penuntutannya...

169
00:09:55,658 --> 00:09:56,909
...sudah lama berakhir.

170
00:10:09,312 --> 00:10:13,858
KTP: JUNG YOUNG-HEE

171
00:10:13,942 --> 00:10:18,113
RUMAH DUKA

172
00:10:23,910 --> 00:10:26,162
Jangan bekerja terlalu keras.
Lagi pula, tak ada orang.

173
00:10:41,261 --> 00:10:41,990
Itu kau?

174
00:10:42,409 --> 00:10:43,055
Ya.

175
00:10:43,555 --> 00:10:44,597
Oke.

176
00:10:45,557 --> 00:10:47,162
Orang dari asosiasi datang?

177
00:10:47,308 --> 00:10:50,603
Belum, tapi mereka
mengirim karangan bunga.

178
00:11:00,154 --> 00:11:01,781
- Ayah.
- Ya?

179
00:11:03,991 --> 00:11:05,743
Bukankah Ibu...

180
00:11:06,786 --> 00:11:11,040
...kabur dan menelantarkan kita?

181
00:11:12,333 --> 00:11:14,210
Ayah juga mengira begitu.

182
00:11:18,548 --> 00:11:21,384
Ayah pulang kerja,

183
00:11:22,051 --> 00:11:23,386
dan hanya ada kau di kamar.

184
00:11:24,011 --> 00:11:25,638
Dia tak ada.

185
00:11:27,181 --> 00:11:30,017
Itu saja.

186
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:36,524
Tak ada yang mencari dia
atau semacamnya?

187
00:11:37,775 --> 00:11:38,943
Tidak ada.

188
00:11:40,611 --> 00:11:44,198
Kami putus hubungan
dengan keluarga kami.

189
00:11:45,616 --> 00:11:51,539
Dia tak punya musuh, bukan?

190
00:11:52,888 --> 00:11:54,139
Tentu saja tidak.

191
00:11:54,834 --> 00:11:57,461
Ibumu orang baik.

192
00:11:58,212 --> 00:11:59,380
Maksudku...

193
00:12:00,548 --> 00:12:01,674
Kenapa kau berkata begitu?

194
00:12:01,871 --> 00:12:02,925
Tidak apa-apa.

195
00:12:03,634 --> 00:12:05,678
Hanya saja...

196
00:12:07,263 --> 00:12:08,405
...setelah 40 tahun, tiba-tiba mendengar...

197
00:12:08,430 --> 00:12:09,890
...dia meninggal.

198
00:12:09,974 --> 00:12:12,142
Aku hanya penasaran, jangan khawatir.

199
00:12:16,355 --> 00:12:17,398
Permisi.

200
00:12:19,274 --> 00:12:22,111
Ada tamu, Ayah. Produser itu.

201
00:12:22,611 --> 00:12:23,654
Silakan masuk.

202
00:12:24,780 --> 00:12:26,365
Aku seharusnya menyiapkan ini.

203
00:12:34,180 --> 00:12:37,225
Hal seperti ini terjadi di tengah syuting,

204
00:12:37,251 --> 00:12:39,975
aku tak tahu harus berkata apa.

205
00:12:40,001 --> 00:12:42,504
Maafkan aku.

206
00:12:43,632 --> 00:12:46,176
Sepertinya ini akan mengganggu siaran,

207
00:12:47,135 --> 00:12:47,782
tak apa?

208
00:12:47,808 --> 00:12:49,805
Tak boleh ada gangguan.

209
00:12:50,305 --> 00:12:52,432
Kami akan bersama kalian sampai akhir.

210
00:12:54,101 --> 00:12:56,853
- Apa?
- Seperti kubilang,

211
00:12:56,937 --> 00:12:58,522
jadwalnya sudah pasti,

212
00:12:58,605 --> 00:13:01,066
dan tak boleh ada penundaan.

213
00:13:01,483 --> 00:13:04,653
Selain itu, momen ini
mungkin akan terasa...

214
00:13:04,736 --> 00:13:06,947
...lebih nyata bagi para penonton.

215
00:13:10,409 --> 00:13:11,660
Tapi...

216
00:13:13,036 --> 00:13:15,872
Maksudku, ini agak...

217
00:13:16,289 --> 00:13:17,833
Tenang saja.

218
00:13:18,264 --> 00:13:19,766
Kami akan menangani semuanya.

219
00:13:21,085 --> 00:13:22,628
Baiklah, tapi...

220
00:13:24,714 --> 00:13:26,883
...ayahku mungkin tak merasa begitu.

221
00:13:26,967 --> 00:13:28,593
Aku mengandalkanmu.

222
00:13:30,303 --> 00:13:31,555
Ini pasti tempatnya.

223
00:13:36,935 --> 00:13:39,980
Silakan. Aku akan segera kembali.

224
00:13:43,191 --> 00:13:44,234
Halo.

225
00:13:45,193 --> 00:13:46,361
Ada yang bisa kubantu?

226
00:13:46,778 --> 00:13:48,947
Dia pasti putranya.

227
00:13:49,781 --> 00:13:52,158
Aku bibimu, kami kakak ibumu.

228
00:14:02,377 --> 00:14:04,671
Setelah mendapat telepon dari polisi,

229
00:14:06,714 --> 00:14:10,802
kami pikir sebaiknya kami datang.

230
00:14:10,885 --> 00:14:14,889
Lagi pula, dia bibiku.

231
00:14:15,241 --> 00:14:16,558
Ya.

232
00:14:17,225 --> 00:14:21,104
Aku juga ingin
memberi penghormatan dengan tulus.

233
00:14:21,479 --> 00:14:23,982
Terima kasih sudah datang.

234
00:14:24,288 --> 00:14:24,989
Ya.

235
00:14:30,988 --> 00:14:32,407
Selain itu,

236
00:14:33,408 --> 00:14:36,244
kami datang untuk menjelaskan sesuatu.

237
00:14:37,135 --> 00:14:39,805
Kakekku meninggalkan sedikit warisan...

238
00:14:39,831 --> 00:14:45,169
...kepada ibuku dan ibumu,

239
00:14:45,776 --> 00:14:48,067
tapi kami tak mau berbagi.

240
00:14:52,249 --> 00:14:52,917
Apa?

241
00:14:53,219 --> 00:14:56,576
Kata ibuku,

242
00:14:56,649 --> 00:15:00,268
ibumu meninggalkan rumah
saat dia masih sangat muda,

243
00:15:00,294 --> 00:15:02,286
jadi dia tak berinteraksi dengan kami...

244
00:15:02,311 --> 00:15:03,854
Begitu rupanya.

245
00:15:05,439 --> 00:15:06,816
Aku agak kaget,

246
00:15:06,842 --> 00:15:08,343
tapi aku tak butuh uang itu.

247
00:15:09,110 --> 00:15:10,611
Ini sangat mendadak...

248
00:15:14,657 --> 00:15:16,966
Selain itu, membahas uang...

249
00:15:17,032 --> 00:15:19,492
...pada saat seperti ini
sepertinya tidak tepat.

250
00:15:21,163 --> 00:15:22,289
Ayah tak keberatan, bukan?

251
00:15:23,958 --> 00:15:24,834
Ya.

252
00:15:26,947 --> 00:15:27,753
Hei.

253
00:15:29,755 --> 00:15:31,006
Maaf soal itu.

254
00:15:33,008 --> 00:15:35,344
Kupikir kau akan setuju.

255
00:15:35,912 --> 00:15:38,488
Kalau begitu, bolehkah kami
merekam percakapan...

256
00:15:38,514 --> 00:15:39,598
Astaga!

257
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,664
Nanti,

258
00:15:44,103 --> 00:15:46,814
aku akan menulis pernyataan resmi...

259
00:15:47,439 --> 00:15:49,733
...dan membawanya ke notaris.

260
00:15:50,397 --> 00:15:52,024
Aku akan mengirimkannya.

261
00:15:53,070 --> 00:15:53,821
Itu cukup?

262
00:15:54,113 --> 00:15:55,280
Baiklah.

263
00:15:55,948 --> 00:15:57,116
Maaf.

264
00:16:01,620 --> 00:16:03,251
Aku tak butuh apa pun,

265
00:16:03,277 --> 00:16:05,321
tapi aku merasa tak enak...

266
00:16:05,347 --> 00:16:07,849
...mengadakan pemakaman
bahkan tanpa foto,

267
00:16:09,837 --> 00:16:11,630
jadi aku ingin meminta tolong.

268
00:16:11,713 --> 00:16:13,590
Jika kalian punya fotonya,

269
00:16:13,674 --> 00:16:16,134
bisakah kalian berikan padaku?

270
00:16:18,178 --> 00:16:19,346
Tidak ada.

271
00:16:19,429 --> 00:16:20,389
Tidak ada fotonya.

272
00:16:20,931 --> 00:16:21,723
Apa?

273
00:16:22,808 --> 00:16:23,850
Tak ada.

274
00:16:24,351 --> 00:16:26,228
Dia tak suka difoto.

275
00:16:27,896 --> 00:16:28,960
Wajahnya...

276
00:16:29,729 --> 00:16:31,961
...agak jelek...

277
00:16:34,194 --> 00:16:35,779
Kurasa kau takkan tahu.

278
00:16:36,655 --> 00:16:37,906
Young-hee...

279
00:16:38,970 --> 00:16:40,930
...tak suka difoto...

280
00:16:41,660 --> 00:16:44,246
...karena dia jelek.

281
00:16:51,336 --> 00:16:54,339
WAWANCARA PERTAMA

282
00:16:55,990 --> 00:16:57,220
Jelek?

283
00:16:59,573 --> 00:17:01,117
Apa maksud kalian?

284
00:17:04,766 --> 00:17:06,643
Apa dia memiliki disabilitas?

285
00:17:07,394 --> 00:17:09,854
Dia memiliki kekurangan,

286
00:17:09,938 --> 00:17:12,857
tapi dia bukan difabel.

287
00:17:14,143 --> 00:17:15,991
Dia cuma jelek saja.

288
00:17:16,017 --> 00:17:19,343
Kenapa kalian terus mengatakan itu?

289
00:17:20,115 --> 00:17:21,720
Tadi pun,

290
00:17:22,283 --> 00:17:24,619
kalian bilang dia kabur saat masih kecil.

291
00:17:25,412 --> 00:17:26,788
- Ya.
- Dia kabur...

292
00:17:26,814 --> 00:17:28,200
...dari rumah begitu saja?

293
00:17:28,226 --> 00:17:30,291
Ya, dia pergi tanpa memberi tahu.

294
00:17:30,375 --> 00:17:32,168
Apa itu masuk akal?

295
00:17:32,252 --> 00:17:35,338
Anak kecil? Kabur tanpa alasan?

296
00:17:35,421 --> 00:17:36,756
Kalian tak pernah curiga?

297
00:17:36,840 --> 00:17:39,175
Dia bisa saja diculik.

298
00:17:39,801 --> 00:17:40,927
Orang gila mana...

299
00:17:41,010 --> 00:17:43,721
...yang menculik anak sangat jelek?

300
00:17:43,846 --> 00:17:45,181
Dia pergi begitu saja!

301
00:17:45,598 --> 00:17:47,809
Young-hee...

302
00:17:48,434 --> 00:17:51,896
...mengatakan cerita-cerita aneh
kepada para tetangga.

303
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:54,232
Cerita apa?

304
00:17:55,490 --> 00:17:57,034
Dia berkata...

305
00:17:57,902 --> 00:18:02,865
...dia melihat ayah kami bersama
wanita lain, keduanya telanjang,

306
00:18:03,658 --> 00:18:05,076
di kantor real estatnya.

307
00:18:06,667 --> 00:18:09,128
Jadi, ibu kami marah...

308
00:18:10,081 --> 00:18:12,750
...dan memukulinya sangat parah.

309
00:18:13,543 --> 00:18:17,630
Setelah itu, dia sakit beberapa hari,

310
00:18:18,840 --> 00:18:20,174
lalu pergi begitu saja.

311
00:18:21,008 --> 00:18:22,718
Dia tak hanya pergi,

312
00:18:22,969 --> 00:18:26,097
dia mengambil semua perhiasan
dan barang berharga Ibu.

313
00:18:26,806 --> 00:18:29,892
Bagi Ibu, dia bukan putrinya,
tapi pencuri.

314
00:18:29,976 --> 00:18:30,977
Itu tidak benar.

315
00:18:33,589 --> 00:18:36,212
Jika suami selingkuh,

316
00:18:36,774 --> 00:18:39,026
dia yang harus disalahkan.

317
00:18:39,110 --> 00:18:40,945
Memukuli anak kecil karena jujur?

318
00:18:41,028 --> 00:18:42,738
Bukankah itu salah ibunya?

319
00:18:42,822 --> 00:18:45,741
Kami keluarga yang sangat bahagia,

320
00:18:45,825 --> 00:18:47,284
dan anak itu...

321
00:18:47,311 --> 00:18:48,848
...menghancurkannya dengan rumor.

322
00:18:49,052 --> 00:18:51,221
Tentu saja dia harus dipukuli
habis-habisan!

323
00:18:51,247 --> 00:18:52,595
Jangan bicara seperti itu!

324
00:18:52,633 --> 00:18:53,749
Pokoknya,

325
00:18:54,575 --> 00:18:58,337
itu yang kami tahu tentang Young-hee.

326
00:18:59,338 --> 00:19:00,297
Setelah itu,

327
00:19:02,216 --> 00:19:03,717
kami tak berhubungan lagi dengan dia.

328
00:19:04,176 --> 00:19:05,803
Dengan semua perhiasan
yang dia ambil,

329
00:19:05,886 --> 00:19:07,847
dia mendapat
lebih dari bagian warisannya.

330
00:19:09,056 --> 00:19:11,225
Dia hanya disebut keluarga
sebagai formalitas.

331
00:19:13,394 --> 00:19:15,354
Kami sudah melakukan bagian kami...

332
00:19:16,021 --> 00:19:17,398
...dengan datang ke sini, bukan?

333
00:19:17,940 --> 00:19:19,775
Benar, Bibi.

334
00:19:19,801 --> 00:19:22,512
Kalau begitu, kita pergi?

335
00:19:22,653 --> 00:19:24,029
Ya, ayo.

336
00:19:40,879 --> 00:19:42,256
Ya, Bos.

337
00:19:42,339 --> 00:19:44,716
Pak, kau harus percaya padaku.

338
00:19:45,647 --> 00:19:47,774
Kurasa cerita istrinya...

339
00:19:48,216 --> 00:19:49,847
...bahkan lebih menarik.

340
00:19:50,305 --> 00:19:52,891
Aku punya firasat kuat...

341
00:19:53,047 --> 00:19:56,675
...kita menemukan
cerita lebih menarik di sini.

342
00:19:59,606 --> 00:20:01,149
Aku yakin.

343
00:20:01,233 --> 00:20:03,694
Ini cerita yang sangat menarik.

344
00:20:05,153 --> 00:20:09,533
Menghibur? Tentu saja!

345
00:20:10,992 --> 00:20:13,537
Kalau begitu, aku akan bekerja.

346
00:20:14,996 --> 00:20:18,375
Oke, terima kasih, dah.

347
00:20:44,234 --> 00:20:46,111
Ayah bisa berdiri di sini.

348
00:21:03,461 --> 00:21:05,046
Jadi...

349
00:21:06,464 --> 00:21:09,759
...ini kali pertamaku
membungkus kerangka,

350
00:21:11,010 --> 00:21:13,221
tapi aku berusaha menyusunnya
sebaik mungkin.

351
00:21:14,389 --> 00:21:15,598
Jika kalian ingin mengucapkan...

352
00:21:15,682 --> 00:21:17,058
...kata-kata terakhir, silakan.

353
00:21:20,770 --> 00:21:21,813
Tak banyak.

354
00:21:22,011 --> 00:21:23,690
Young-hee, beristirahatlah dalam damai.

355
00:21:24,107 --> 00:21:25,525
Jika ada yang ingin kalian katakan,

356
00:21:25,608 --> 00:21:27,026
cepatlah agar kita bisa pergi.

357
00:21:27,110 --> 00:21:28,820
Aku mudah mual.

358
00:21:38,579 --> 00:21:40,852
Jika tak ada, sudah saja.

359
00:21:41,402 --> 00:21:42,945
Aku mual.

360
00:21:55,096 --> 00:21:57,056
Astaga...

361
00:21:57,907 --> 00:22:00,629
Kau tahu berapa lama
aku menyusunnya?

362
00:22:01,143 --> 00:22:03,229
Lagi pula, itu akan dikremasi.

363
00:22:03,620 --> 00:22:04,996
Tapi maaf.

364
00:22:05,022 --> 00:22:06,565
Aku tak tahan.

365
00:22:07,984 --> 00:22:09,193
Astaga...

366
00:22:09,735 --> 00:22:11,570
Ayah, tenang, tak ada apa-apa.

367
00:22:13,781 --> 00:22:15,449
Ibu baik-baik saja?

368
00:22:19,328 --> 00:22:20,371
Sebentar.

369
00:22:21,664 --> 00:22:24,458
- Ayah, aku harus jawab telepon.
- Ya.

370
00:22:30,714 --> 00:22:31,444
Halo, Produser Kim.

371
00:22:31,674 --> 00:22:32,946
<i>Halo?</i>

372
00:22:34,218 --> 00:22:37,346
<i>Kau tahu gedung...</i>

373
00:22:37,429 --> 00:22:38,889
<i>...tempat orang tuamu pertama bertemu?</i>

374
00:22:38,973 --> 00:22:39,890
Apa?

375
00:22:39,974 --> 00:22:41,976
<i>Yang di foto,</i>

376
00:22:42,059 --> 00:22:44,395
<i>di depan tempat stempel.</i>

377
00:22:46,188 --> 00:22:47,127
Ya, kenapa?

378
00:22:47,690 --> 00:22:50,234
<i>Aku mencari tahu dan ternyata...</i>

379
00:22:50,317 --> 00:22:51,819
<i>...dia bekerja di sebuah pabrik...</i>

380
00:22:51,902 --> 00:22:55,406
<i>...di gedung itu
bernama Cheongpung Garments.</i>

381
00:22:57,366 --> 00:23:00,077
Cheongpung Garments?

382
00:23:00,423 --> 00:23:01,683
<i>Ya.</i>

383
00:23:01,912 --> 00:23:05,186
<i>Cheongpung Engraving,
Cheongpung Garments.</i>

384
00:23:06,208 --> 00:23:07,480
<i>Menarik, bukan?</i>

385
00:23:09,601 --> 00:23:11,853
Ya, kurasa...

386
00:23:12,506 --> 00:23:17,386
<i>Aku menghubungi
beberapa pekerja pabrik saat itu.</i>

387
00:23:17,469 --> 00:23:20,180
<i>Mereka bilang mereka kenal ibumu.</i>

388
00:23:20,806 --> 00:23:21,765
<i>Jadi,</i>

389
00:23:23,797 --> 00:23:24,977
<i>jika kau senggang besok,</i>

390
00:23:25,060 --> 00:23:28,772
<i>mau ikut kami mengobrol
dengan mereka?</i>

391
00:23:40,617 --> 00:23:41,535
Bagus?

392
00:23:41,618 --> 00:23:42,661
Begini?

393
00:23:45,997 --> 00:23:47,040
Coba kulihat.

394
00:23:55,006 --> 00:23:56,341
Diam di van.

395
00:23:58,176 --> 00:23:59,386
Kau sudah datang.

396
00:24:01,972 --> 00:24:03,035
Nona Kim,

397
00:24:04,432 --> 00:24:06,434
aku berterima kasih, tapi...

398
00:24:06,518 --> 00:24:07,936
Tak apa!

399
00:24:08,019 --> 00:24:10,313
Tidak, bukan itu maksudku.

400
00:24:12,023 --> 00:24:13,692
Kau tak perlu sejauh ini.

401
00:24:13,775 --> 00:24:14,734
Tidak.

402
00:24:14,818 --> 00:24:16,987
Aku pada dasarnya jurnalis,

403
00:24:17,070 --> 00:24:19,030
jadi menggali sebuah cerita
sangat menyenangkan.

404
00:24:20,493 --> 00:24:22,742
Ayo masuk! Mereka sudah menunggu.

405
00:24:23,076 --> 00:24:25,328
Oke? Ayo.

406
00:24:28,873 --> 00:24:31,876
WAWANCARA KEDUA

407
00:24:36,256 --> 00:24:37,507
Selamat sore.

408
00:24:38,633 --> 00:24:40,176
Hai.

409
00:24:40,260 --> 00:24:41,302
Silakan duduk.

410
00:24:46,474 --> 00:24:47,767
Mau minum apa?

411
00:24:47,850 --> 00:24:49,561
Apa saja.

412
00:24:49,644 --> 00:24:51,396
Jus saja.

413
00:24:51,479 --> 00:24:52,939
Baik.

414
00:24:56,317 --> 00:24:57,735
Aku Kim Su-jin,

415
00:24:57,819 --> 00:25:00,571
produser yang menghubungi kalian.

416
00:25:02,031 --> 00:25:03,074
Silakan.

417
00:25:04,033 --> 00:25:06,035
Dan siapa dia?

418
00:25:07,745 --> 00:25:09,747
Ini...

419
00:25:10,540 --> 00:25:11,582
Aku penulis.

420
00:25:12,208 --> 00:25:13,918
- Penulis?
- Benarkah?

421
00:25:14,244 --> 00:25:15,001
Ya,

422
00:25:15,169 --> 00:25:16,838
penulis kami.

423
00:25:16,921 --> 00:25:20,049
Jadi, kau produser TV?

424
00:25:20,591 --> 00:25:21,968
Apa ini untuk berita?

425
00:25:22,418 --> 00:25:23,732
Ya, semacam itu.

426
00:25:24,466 --> 00:25:29,179
Kami sedang menyelidiki
cerita Bu Jung Young-hee.

427
00:25:30,184 --> 00:25:32,853
Jasadnya ditemukan...

428
00:25:32,937 --> 00:25:37,566
...di dekat pabrik garmen
tempat kalian bekerja dulu.

429
00:25:37,650 --> 00:25:40,236
Sepertinya dia meninggal 40 tahun lalu.

430
00:25:40,820 --> 00:25:41,779
Astaga...

431
00:25:41,862 --> 00:25:43,072
Saat kau menelepon,

432
00:25:43,155 --> 00:25:45,992
kami kira dia meninggal di tempat jauh.

433
00:25:47,576 --> 00:25:49,954
Dulu dia menghilang begitu saja,

434
00:25:50,037 --> 00:25:51,956
jadi kami kira dia kabur.

435
00:25:53,541 --> 00:25:56,627
Sepertinya hal buruk menimpanya.

436
00:25:56,710 --> 00:25:57,878
Astaga...

437
00:25:58,587 --> 00:26:02,716
Dia berhenti datang
ke pabrik begitu saja?

438
00:26:02,800 --> 00:26:06,512
Ya, jadi kami kira dia kabur.

439
00:26:08,639 --> 00:26:09,974
Apa ada...

440
00:26:11,141 --> 00:26:14,144
...orang di pabrik itu,

441
00:26:14,228 --> 00:26:18,482
yang dekat dengan dia?

442
00:26:18,565 --> 00:26:19,942
Satu-satunya orang...

443
00:26:20,901 --> 00:26:23,466
...yang dekat dengan Tinja Raksasa...

444
00:26:23,904 --> 00:26:25,656
...adalah pria tunanetra...

445
00:26:25,909 --> 00:26:28,492
...yang akhirnya menikahi dia.

446
00:26:29,326 --> 00:26:30,411
'Tinja Raksasa'?

447
00:26:31,042 --> 00:26:31,861
Ah, itu.

448
00:26:31,912 --> 00:26:33,810
Kami memanggilnya 'Tinja Raksasa'...

449
00:26:34,289 --> 00:26:37,167
...karena wajahnya.

450
00:26:38,210 --> 00:26:40,129
Hei.

451
00:26:40,879 --> 00:26:43,841
Tak ada yang benar-benar
terlihat seperti tinja,

452
00:26:44,633 --> 00:26:48,887
tapi ada alasan di balik julukan itu.

453
00:26:49,930 --> 00:26:51,682
Apa alasannya?

454
00:26:54,434 --> 00:26:55,811
Aku tak bisa...

455
00:26:56,296 --> 00:26:58,438
Ayolah, kau bisa memberitahuku.

456
00:26:59,333 --> 00:27:00,397
Itu sudah lama.

457
00:27:02,109 --> 00:27:03,277
Dulu,

458
00:27:03,360 --> 00:27:05,508
semuanya sangat sibuk.

459
00:27:06,863 --> 00:27:08,949
Itu benar-benar masa kejayaan.

460
00:27:09,387 --> 00:27:12,911
Kami sangat sibuk,
tiap hari sangat kacau.

461
00:27:14,538 --> 00:27:19,000
Negara ini benar-benar berjaya.

462
00:28:02,293 --> 00:28:04,587
CHEONGPUNG GARMENTS

463
00:28:07,173 --> 00:28:09,884
Young-hee! Kenapa kau lama sekali?

464
00:28:09,968 --> 00:28:12,929
Cepat bawa kainnya! Cepat!

465
00:28:31,614 --> 00:28:35,368
Hei, sudah kubilang bereskan ini.

466
00:28:36,285 --> 00:28:38,705
Kau main-main dengan ini seharian!

467
00:28:42,125 --> 00:28:44,961
Permisi, Bos...

468
00:28:45,795 --> 00:28:47,547
Maaf, tapi...

469
00:28:48,506 --> 00:28:50,779
...bolehkah aku ke kamar mandi?

470
00:28:50,925 --> 00:28:53,344
Kita sibuk bekerja, tak ada waktu!

471
00:28:53,427 --> 00:28:55,304
Maaf...

472
00:28:57,390 --> 00:28:59,684
Ini mendesak...

473
00:29:00,393 --> 00:29:01,561
Kembali dalam semenit.

474
00:29:02,144 --> 00:29:03,312
Terima kasih.

475
00:29:19,036 --> 00:29:21,163
TOILET

476
00:29:43,269 --> 00:29:46,021
Dia mengartikan kata-katanya
secara literal...

477
00:29:46,105 --> 00:29:48,190
...dan tak sempat buang air besar.

478
00:29:48,816 --> 00:29:52,111
Dia akhirnya buang air besar di celana.

479
00:29:59,797 --> 00:30:01,758
Bersihkan sekarang!

480
00:30:05,499 --> 00:30:09,503
Itu benar-benar pemandangan
yang aneh dan menyedihkan.

481
00:30:09,586 --> 00:30:11,901
Wajahnya cukup buruk,

482
00:30:12,172 --> 00:30:14,842
tapi kemudian dia buang air di celana...

483
00:30:15,634 --> 00:30:19,638
Semua orang memanggilnya
'Tinja Raksasa' setelah itu.

484
00:30:25,310 --> 00:30:29,606
Seperti apa wajahnya...

485
00:30:29,690 --> 00:30:32,693
...sampai orang-orang
sering membicarakan penampilannya?

486
00:30:33,235 --> 00:30:37,447
Apa dia memiliki kelainan
bentuk wajah atau semacamnya?

487
00:30:37,531 --> 00:30:38,782
Kelainan?

488
00:30:39,449 --> 00:30:44,663
Sulit menggambarkan wajahnya...

489
00:30:46,159 --> 00:30:48,709
Intinya, tidak bagus. Dia jelek.

490
00:30:51,670 --> 00:30:57,175
Apa kalian punya fotonya?

491
00:30:57,259 --> 00:30:58,969
- Foto?
- Foto...

492
00:30:59,761 --> 00:31:01,096
Entahlah...

493
00:31:02,764 --> 00:31:06,476
Dulu, kami tak sering berfoto.

494
00:31:07,060 --> 00:31:11,064
Tapi kami harus melampirkan foto
saat diterima kerja.

495
00:31:11,731 --> 00:31:13,400
Mungkin masih ada?

496
00:31:14,346 --> 00:31:17,299
Itu sudah lama, aku ragu masih ada.

497
00:31:18,863 --> 00:31:20,240
Apa ada...

498
00:31:20,907 --> 00:31:24,953
...orang yang mungkin dendam
kepada dia?

499
00:31:25,870 --> 00:31:27,914
Orang tak menyukainya...

500
00:31:27,997 --> 00:31:29,958
...karena dia kotor
dan terlihat seperti monster,

501
00:31:30,041 --> 00:31:31,981
tapi hatinya baik,

502
00:31:32,127 --> 00:31:34,337
dia tak pernah punya musuh.

503
00:31:34,421 --> 00:31:35,755
Benar.

504
00:31:36,339 --> 00:31:38,466
Meski begitu,

505
00:31:38,550 --> 00:31:40,510
dia menikahi pria tunanetra itu.

506
00:31:42,262 --> 00:31:44,305
Hidupnya mungkin bahagia.

507
00:31:46,641 --> 00:31:47,684
Tidak,

508
00:31:50,061 --> 00:31:54,169
kurasa dia terlibat sesuatu...

509
00:31:55,900 --> 00:31:57,110
...dengan bos kami.

510
00:31:58,532 --> 00:31:59,575
Ya, tentu.

511
00:32:00,738 --> 00:32:04,325
Apa yang terjadi dengan bos kalian?

512
00:32:05,410 --> 00:32:07,161
Jangan bicarakan itu.

513
00:32:07,537 --> 00:32:10,331
Dia pria baik,

514
00:32:10,540 --> 00:32:12,834
dia tak mungkin melakukan apa pun
kepada Tinja Raksasa.

515
00:32:13,126 --> 00:32:16,796
Berkat dia, kami tak kelaparan dulu.

516
00:32:18,681 --> 00:32:20,508
Tolong ceritakan.

517
00:32:21,126 --> 00:32:21,672
Ya?

518
00:32:28,266 --> 00:32:29,934
Tak apa.

519
00:32:32,770 --> 00:32:35,523
Kau harus tanya Jin-sook soal itu...

520
00:32:36,399 --> 00:32:37,900
Apa? Siapa?

521
00:32:42,655 --> 00:32:46,367
Hei, aku harus mencari tahu
beberapa hal.

522
00:32:46,450 --> 00:32:48,869
Aku harus menghubungi siapa
untuk mendapatkannya?

523
00:32:51,539 --> 00:32:53,290
Aku harus mencari...

524
00:32:53,374 --> 00:32:56,127
...bos pabrik garmen pada tahun 1970-an.

525
00:32:58,379 --> 00:33:02,591
Oke, kirimkan kontaknya.

526
00:33:02,883 --> 00:33:04,593
Ya, kirimkan.

527
00:33:05,052 --> 00:33:07,638
Terima kasih, dah.

528
00:33:08,973 --> 00:33:10,391
Dia cepat menggali informasi.

529
00:33:10,637 --> 00:33:11,534
Kita akan segera dapat petunjuk.

530
00:33:11,559 --> 00:33:13,727
Nona Kim, jangan lakukan ini.

531
00:33:15,437 --> 00:33:16,789
Aku akan mengurusnya mulai sekarang,

532
00:33:16,814 --> 00:33:18,023
ini masalah keluarga.

533
00:33:18,107 --> 00:33:20,651
Tidak apa-apa.

534
00:33:20,776 --> 00:33:22,820
Aku tak keberatan.

535
00:33:23,904 --> 00:33:25,197
Aku pergi lebih dulu.

536
00:33:27,491 --> 00:33:29,493
Besok kuhubungi.

537
00:33:40,838 --> 00:33:42,172
Hati-hati.

538
00:33:45,968 --> 00:33:47,761
Hati-hati.

539
00:33:47,845 --> 00:33:49,763
Terima kasih.

540
00:33:49,847 --> 00:33:51,640
- Hati-hati!
- Dah.

541
00:34:32,806 --> 00:34:34,516
IM YEONG-GYU

542
00:34:40,355 --> 00:34:43,608
KEAJAIBAN HIDUP DI KOREA:
IM YEONG-GYU

543
00:34:43,692 --> 00:34:46,152
PAMERAN
PENGUKIR TUNANETRA, IM YEONG-GYU

544
00:35:02,127 --> 00:35:04,504
KITA AKAN MENEMUI LEE JIN-SOOK
BESOK DI RUMAHNYA

545
00:35:04,587 --> 00:35:08,258
AKU JUGA MENEMUKAN BOS PABRIK.
SAMPAI JUMPA BESOK!

546
00:35:23,064 --> 00:35:26,067
WAWANCARA KETIGA

547
00:35:30,571 --> 00:35:33,032
PRODUSER KIM SU-JIN

548
00:35:39,163 --> 00:35:40,039
Jadi?

549
00:35:40,998 --> 00:35:42,750
Apa yang ingin kalian tahu?

550
00:35:43,835 --> 00:35:46,087
Kami datang untuk mendengar...

551
00:35:46,113 --> 00:35:48,381
...hari-hari terakhir Bu Jung Young-hee.

552
00:35:48,407 --> 00:35:49,408
Tunggu...

553
00:35:50,149 --> 00:35:52,250
Apa hubungan ibuku...

554
00:35:52,301 --> 00:35:56,597
...dengan Jung Young-hee
sampai kalian jauh-jauh kemari?

555
00:36:01,102 --> 00:36:03,938
- Eh...
- Dia asisten jahitku.

556
00:36:05,398 --> 00:36:10,695
Dia beberapa tahun lebih tua dariku.

557
00:36:12,238 --> 00:36:14,240
Aku membuatnya bekerja sangat keras.

558
00:36:16,867 --> 00:36:18,869
Jika dia sungguh...

559
00:36:19,578 --> 00:36:23,040
...meninggal saat itu...

560
00:36:25,918 --> 00:36:28,087
...berarti sebagiannya salahku.

561
00:36:32,842 --> 00:36:38,931
Aku sangat kejam padanya.

562
00:36:43,880 --> 00:36:46,480
Dia tak pernah mengeluh...

563
00:36:48,319 --> 00:36:51,489
...dan hanya bekerja tanpa bicara.

564
00:37:09,406 --> 00:37:10,824
Nona Lee...

565
00:37:19,471 --> 00:37:21,265
Kau belum pergi?

566
00:37:23,892 --> 00:37:26,812
Kenapa kau menangis?

567
00:37:40,411 --> 00:37:41,620
Young-hee...

568
00:37:45,215 --> 00:37:46,884
Aku tak tahu harus bagaimana.

569
00:37:50,544 --> 00:37:52,879
Melihat Young-hee saat itu...

570
00:37:52,963 --> 00:37:55,549
...membuatku ingin mengakui semuanya.

571
00:37:58,468 --> 00:37:59,803
Bos kami saat itu...

572
00:38:02,305 --> 00:38:03,119
...dia...

573
00:38:04,099 --> 00:38:05,454
...memerkosaku.

574
00:38:10,981 --> 00:38:11,711
Apa?

575
00:38:15,819 --> 00:38:17,904
Siapa yang bisa kuberi tahu?

576
00:38:19,072 --> 00:38:22,200
<i>Dia selalu membayar kami tepat waktu,</i>

577
00:38:22,798 --> 00:38:24,633
<i>bahkan memberi kami bonus.</i>

578
00:38:25,495 --> 00:38:28,832
<i>Semua orang memanggilnya malaikat.</i>

579
00:38:30,804 --> 00:38:32,431
- Hei, kalian!
- Halo.

580
00:38:32,711 --> 00:38:33,753
Berdiri di sini.

581
00:38:34,087 --> 00:38:36,131
Aku akan memotret kalian, ayo.

582
00:38:36,214 --> 00:38:37,257
Berdiri tegak.

583
00:38:37,715 --> 00:38:39,300
Ayo.

584
00:38:39,509 --> 00:38:41,636
Satu, dua, tiga.

585
00:38:41,719 --> 00:38:44,514
Cantik sekali! Sekali lagi. Ganti pose.

586
00:38:44,597 --> 00:38:45,807
Seperti Miss Korea.

587
00:38:46,224 --> 00:38:47,016
Sempurna.

588
00:38:47,063 --> 00:38:49,102
Satu, dua, tiga.

589
00:38:50,270 --> 00:38:51,437
Cantik sekali.

590
00:38:51,521 --> 00:38:53,231
- Bagus!
- Terima kasih.

591
00:38:53,257 --> 00:38:54,300
Dah.

592
00:38:55,275 --> 00:38:56,859
Memalukan sekali.

593
00:38:56,943 --> 00:38:59,633
Aku akan mencetak fotonya
untuk kalian.

594
00:39:27,765 --> 00:39:28,933
Maaf...

595
00:39:30,178 --> 00:39:32,722
Pasti cukup sulit mengukir stempel...

596
00:39:33,307 --> 00:39:35,356
...dan aku membuatmu menjaga
Dong-hwan.

597
00:39:36,566 --> 00:39:37,775
Hentikan.

598
00:39:39,193 --> 00:39:42,071
Menjaga bayiku juga tanggung jawabku.

599
00:39:44,907 --> 00:39:49,412
Aku akan cepat menabung
agar kau bisa berhenti kerja...

600
00:39:50,037 --> 00:39:52,665
...dan fokus membesarkan Dong-hwan.

601
00:39:59,380 --> 00:40:00,548
Apa ada masalah?

602
00:40:02,591 --> 00:40:04,218
Tidak...

603
00:40:06,835 --> 00:40:07,920
Tapi, Sayang,

604
00:40:09,807 --> 00:40:13,769
jika orang jahat pura-pura
menjadi orang baik,

605
00:40:15,271 --> 00:40:19,775
apa itu membuat mereka jahat?
Atau baik?

606
00:40:21,360 --> 00:40:22,544
Apa maksudmu?

607
00:40:25,864 --> 00:40:27,199
Lupakan.

608
00:40:41,130 --> 00:40:42,381
Pagi.

609
00:40:42,464 --> 00:40:43,298
Ya.

610
00:40:43,757 --> 00:40:47,010
Penjahitmu kembali absen
tanpa pemberitahuan.

611
00:40:47,151 --> 00:40:49,925
Aku sungguh harus menyuruh Bos
mengganti dia.

612
00:40:49,951 --> 00:40:51,765
Tepat di saat waktu tersibuk?

613
00:40:51,849 --> 00:40:52,766
Apa?

614
00:40:54,184 --> 00:40:56,270
Kau sudah coba menghubunginya?

615
00:40:56,937 --> 00:41:00,732
Mungkin dia sakit.
Merekrut orang baru tiba-tiba...

616
00:41:00,816 --> 00:41:02,067
Tinja Raksasa.

617
00:41:03,110 --> 00:41:05,112
Sepertinya pernikahanmu bahagia.

618
00:41:05,195 --> 00:41:07,155
Kau bisa berpendapat sekarang?

619
00:41:08,448 --> 00:41:11,660
Si tunanetra itu pasti
memperlakukanmu dengan baik.

620
00:41:11,952 --> 00:41:14,538
Ini bukan saatnya kau ikut campur.

621
00:41:17,916 --> 00:41:19,000
Lupakan.

622
00:41:37,269 --> 00:41:38,603
Dengar.

623
00:41:39,229 --> 00:41:41,314
Penjahit baru mulai bekerja besok.

624
00:41:41,398 --> 00:41:43,441
Tinja Raksasa,
kau akan menjadi asistennya.

625
00:41:43,775 --> 00:41:46,570
Apa? Bagaimana dengan Nn. Lee?

626
00:41:47,465 --> 00:41:48,905
Dia tak bekerja dua hari.

627
00:41:48,989 --> 00:41:50,573
Jika begini, kita akan melewatkan
tenggat waktu pengiriman.

628
00:41:50,824 --> 00:41:52,784
Bos sudah memutuskan memecatnya.

629
00:41:52,867 --> 00:41:53,827
Hanya itu yang perlu kau tahu.

630
00:41:54,911 --> 00:41:56,496
Bos mengatakan itu?

631
00:41:56,997 --> 00:41:58,289
Kembali bekerja.

632
00:41:59,124 --> 00:41:59,958
Hei.

633
00:42:00,330 --> 00:42:02,377
Hei!

634
00:42:03,015 --> 00:42:04,433
Kau mau ke mana?

635
00:42:06,131 --> 00:42:07,424
Sial.

636
00:42:10,427 --> 00:42:11,636
Sial, ada apa?

637
00:42:15,598 --> 00:42:16,391
Apa?

638
00:42:17,142 --> 00:42:18,226
Bos.

639
00:42:18,747 --> 00:42:25,358
Benarkah kau memecat
Nn. Lee Jin-sook?

640
00:42:26,067 --> 00:42:26,901
Apa?

641
00:42:28,987 --> 00:42:31,281
Kau tak boleh melakukan ini.

642
00:42:31,364 --> 00:42:34,117
Astaga...

643
00:42:34,200 --> 00:42:35,785
Aku berusaha agar kita...

644
00:42:35,868 --> 00:42:37,912
...melewati ini bersama, keluar.

645
00:42:39,831 --> 00:42:42,583
Nona Lee Jin-sook...

646
00:42:42,667 --> 00:42:46,254
...kau tahu kenapa dia tak kerja.

647
00:42:47,171 --> 00:42:49,465
Kau akan terus mengatakan
omong kosong ini?

648
00:42:49,715 --> 00:42:50,800
Tapi kau...

649
00:42:55,096 --> 00:42:58,558
...melakukan hal buruk padanya.

650
00:42:58,584 --> 00:42:59,937
Makanya dia tak datang.

651
00:42:59,963 --> 00:43:01,164
Wanita sial.

652
00:43:02,562 --> 00:43:04,480
Jangan bicara seperti itu padaku!

653
00:43:05,565 --> 00:43:06,440
Keluar.

654
00:43:07,788 --> 00:43:08,830
Keluar!

655
00:43:19,805 --> 00:43:24,625
Dia seharusnya berhenti,
itu bukan urusannya.

656
00:43:30,131 --> 00:43:31,590
Bodoh sekali...

657
00:43:52,635 --> 00:43:53,378
Sayang.

658
00:43:55,657 --> 00:43:56,991
Kau sedang mengerjakan apa?

659
00:43:59,994 --> 00:44:02,454
Bukan apa-apa.

660
00:44:20,973 --> 00:44:22,015
Lihat kalian!

661
00:44:22,599 --> 00:44:24,372
- Aku akan memotret kalian.
- Ayo.

662
00:44:24,685 --> 00:44:26,249
Kalian mau ke mana?

663
00:44:27,938 --> 00:44:30,315
Mereka sangat pemalu.

664
00:44:54,464 --> 00:44:56,758
CEO CHEONGPUNG GARMENTS,
BAEK JOO-SANG

665
00:44:56,842 --> 00:45:00,137
ADALAH ORANG MESUM
YANG MEMERKOSA WANITA

666
00:45:00,846 --> 00:45:03,849
'...yang memerkosa wanita.'

667
00:45:09,771 --> 00:45:10,584
Astaga.

668
00:45:14,693 --> 00:45:16,069
Sialan.

669
00:45:16,424 --> 00:45:18,780
Kau,

670
00:45:19,008 --> 00:45:21,616
bagaimana caramu
mengatur para wanita ini...

671
00:45:21,700 --> 00:45:23,034
...sampai hal seperti ini terjadi?

672
00:45:23,493 --> 00:45:24,327
Dasar tak berguna.

673
00:45:25,912 --> 00:45:27,372
Pecat semua wanita itu.

674
00:45:27,706 --> 00:45:28,540
Apa?

675
00:45:29,098 --> 00:45:31,683
Keluar dan pecat semua wanita itu!

676
00:45:31,710 --> 00:45:32,669
Baik, Pak.

677
00:45:46,599 --> 00:45:47,809
Tinja Raksasa!

678
00:45:48,659 --> 00:45:50,285
Kau berani terus bekerja di sini...

679
00:45:50,311 --> 00:45:51,855
...setelah kekacauan yang kau buat?

680
00:45:53,398 --> 00:45:54,524
'Kekacauan yang kubuat'?

681
00:45:55,066 --> 00:45:56,109
Apa salahku?

682
00:45:56,192 --> 00:45:58,361
Dasar aneh.

683
00:45:58,444 --> 00:46:02,156
Kau menghina bos kita
dan masih berharap dibayar?

684
00:46:02,865 --> 00:46:04,867
Pergi.

685
00:46:05,368 --> 00:46:08,538
Baiklah,
tapi bagaimana dengan Nn. Lee?

686
00:46:08,676 --> 00:46:09,706
Kau akan memecat dia juga?

687
00:46:09,789 --> 00:46:11,791
Ya, Tinja Kotoran!

688
00:46:12,166 --> 00:46:14,085
Kalian tak bisa bekerja...

689
00:46:14,168 --> 00:46:15,670
...di dekat sini, jadi pergi.

690
00:46:15,753 --> 00:46:19,424
Tunggu, dia yang salah...

691
00:46:19,841 --> 00:46:22,593
...dan dia menyuruhmu melakukan ini?

692
00:46:23,928 --> 00:46:26,264
Apa pedulimu?

693
00:46:26,347 --> 00:46:28,766
Aku akan bicara dengan Bos.

694
00:46:29,517 --> 00:46:31,769
Astaga. Jika kau pergi...

695
00:46:32,812 --> 00:46:35,147
Nona Lee...

696
00:46:39,402 --> 00:46:41,195
Cukup.

697
00:46:42,071 --> 00:46:43,572
Kau pikir kau siapa?

698
00:46:47,910 --> 00:46:48,953
Sial...

699
00:46:54,000 --> 00:46:58,129
Young-hee tak tahu.

700
00:46:59,630 --> 00:47:01,590
<i>Jika kita menulis hal seperti itu,</i>

701
00:47:03,351 --> 00:47:06,220
orang tak fokus pada si pelaku Baek,

702
00:47:07,839 --> 00:47:11,510
mereka lebih penasaran
dengan siapa yang diperkosa.

703
00:47:15,020 --> 00:47:16,647
Aku merasa sangat malu...

704
00:47:16,730 --> 00:47:17,857
...orang-orang akan tahu.

705
00:47:21,068 --> 00:47:22,486
Young-hee...

706
00:47:27,075 --> 00:47:28,910
...hanya mencoba membantuku.

707
00:47:37,668 --> 00:47:40,546
Orang itu mungkin menjalani...

708
00:47:40,629 --> 00:47:42,715
...hidup yang sama.

709
00:47:46,093 --> 00:47:52,182
Karena rasa maluku
seperti pengampunannya.

710
00:47:56,061 --> 00:48:01,900
Jika Young-hee mati di tangannya,

711
00:48:03,944 --> 00:48:05,341
mungkin itu salahku...

712
00:48:10,534 --> 00:48:12,515
...karena membiarkannya terjadi.

713
00:48:37,498 --> 00:48:38,624
Ayo pergi.

714
00:48:40,730 --> 00:48:42,065
Ayo temui Baek.

715
00:48:44,693 --> 00:48:47,112
Bisa-bisanya dia melakukan itu
pada wanita tak bersalah...

716
00:48:50,532 --> 00:48:53,118
Kau tak merasa kasihan kepada ibumu?

717
00:48:54,786 --> 00:48:57,810
Kita harus tanya
kenapa dia melakukannya.

718
00:48:59,541 --> 00:49:00,709
Bukankah begitu?

719
00:49:02,836 --> 00:49:04,984
Dia harus membayar perbuatannya.

720
00:49:24,482 --> 00:49:27,485
WAWANCARA KEEMPAT

721
00:50:03,688 --> 00:50:04,960
Ada orang?

722
00:50:23,165 --> 00:50:24,834
Halo, Pak.

723
00:50:30,631 --> 00:50:34,510
Kami dari stasiun TV.

724
00:50:35,845 --> 00:50:38,743
Kenapa stasiun TV?

725
00:50:39,306 --> 00:50:42,810
Kami ingin menanyakan sesuatu.

726
00:50:44,103 --> 00:50:47,335
Namamu Baek Joo-sang, bukan?

727
00:51:02,314 --> 00:51:05,165
Keluar...

728
00:51:11,714 --> 00:51:14,466
Pak, apa kau...

729
00:51:14,591 --> 00:51:18,074
...ingat seseorang
bernama Jung Young-hee?

730
00:51:23,267 --> 00:51:24,184
Siapa?

731
00:51:24,268 --> 00:51:28,397
Dia bekerja di pabrik garmen milikmu.

732
00:51:31,733 --> 00:51:34,528
Terkadang dia dipanggil 'Tinja Raksasa'.

733
00:51:45,706 --> 00:51:50,168
Aku tahu wanita jelek itu.

734
00:51:51,086 --> 00:51:53,463
Oh, kau ingat dia?

735
00:51:53,547 --> 00:51:56,049
Tentu, mana mungkin aku lupa?

736
00:51:57,342 --> 00:52:01,638
Wanita jelek yang tak tahu diri.

737
00:52:04,307 --> 00:52:06,393
Jadi, kau ingat.

738
00:52:07,183 --> 00:52:08,685
Kami di sini...

739
00:52:08,979 --> 00:52:12,566
...untuk mencari tahu tentang
hari-hari terakhir Jung Young-hee.

740
00:52:13,733 --> 00:52:14,776
Pak.

741
00:52:15,264 --> 00:52:18,267
Jika kau tahu sesuatu,
tolong beri tahu kami.

742
00:52:18,530 --> 00:52:21,700
Selain itu, batas penuntutannya
sudah berakhir.

743
00:52:23,576 --> 00:52:27,038
Seharusnya tidak berakhir!

744
00:52:28,992 --> 00:52:31,084
Mereka tak menangkap orang itu?

745
00:52:31,697 --> 00:52:33,628
Siapa orang itu?

746
00:52:38,925 --> 00:52:43,888
Orang tunanetra itu
membunuh istrinya sendiri.

747
00:52:50,019 --> 00:52:54,524
Astaga, mereka belum mengetahuinya?

748
00:52:57,476 --> 00:53:01,521
Orang itu licik.

749
00:53:01,557 --> 00:53:02,740
Dia...

750
00:53:12,333 --> 00:53:14,919
Maklumi saja.

751
00:53:20,717 --> 00:53:21,426
Hei.

752
00:53:21,452 --> 00:53:22,301
Bos.

753
00:53:23,235 --> 00:53:24,861
Dia datang!

754
00:53:24,887 --> 00:53:25,930
Selamat malam.

755
00:53:25,972 --> 00:53:28,141
- Sini, duduk di tengah.
- Ya.

756
00:53:28,224 --> 00:53:29,142
Itu dia!

757
00:53:29,168 --> 00:53:29,928
Sini.

758
00:53:29,954 --> 00:53:33,499
- Sini, tak apa.
- Oke...

759
00:53:34,522 --> 00:53:35,982
- Duduk di sini.
- Kemari.

760
00:53:36,065 --> 00:53:37,817
Pegang tangannya.

761
00:53:40,025 --> 00:53:40,745
Ayo.

762
00:53:40,820 --> 00:53:42,405
- Kau serius?
- Ya.

763
00:53:42,488 --> 00:53:44,115
Jadi, dia pria tunanetra...

764
00:53:44,351 --> 00:53:46,033
...yang mengukir stempel?

765
00:53:46,117 --> 00:53:47,368
Tentu saja!

766
00:53:47,827 --> 00:53:50,913
Dia hebat meskipun tak bisa melihat?

767
00:53:50,997 --> 00:53:52,915
- Itu maksudku!
- Menarik sekali.

768
00:53:53,040 --> 00:53:58,045
Dia mengukir stempel
di gang dekat pabrikku,

769
00:53:58,379 --> 00:54:00,589
dan itu bagus.

770
00:54:03,259 --> 00:54:04,427
Bisa kau tunjukkan?

771
00:54:05,386 --> 00:54:08,556
Ya, Young-gyu, contohkan pada kami.

772
00:54:08,639 --> 00:54:10,307
Mana bisa kulakukan di sini?

773
00:54:10,391 --> 00:54:11,642
Tunjukkan!

774
00:54:11,668 --> 00:54:13,378
Jika kalian datang ke kios,

775
00:54:13,404 --> 00:54:15,146
aku akan memberi harga murah.

776
00:54:15,396 --> 00:54:16,397
Yeong-gyu.

777
00:54:17,624 --> 00:54:19,525
Tunjukkan di sini.

778
00:54:21,719 --> 00:54:23,153
Bagus.

779
00:54:24,154 --> 00:54:25,948
Baiklah, siapa yang butuh stempel?

780
00:54:25,974 --> 00:54:28,121
- Aku!
- Madam Jang!

781
00:54:28,284 --> 00:54:29,994
Baiklah, ukir satu untuk Madam Jang.

782
00:54:30,661 --> 00:54:32,037
'Jang Mi-sook'.

783
00:54:32,121 --> 00:54:33,247
Oke.

784
00:54:34,707 --> 00:54:36,542
Lihat, alatnya keluar.

785
00:54:45,092 --> 00:54:47,386
Jadi, begini caramu membawanya?

786
00:55:00,190 --> 00:55:01,275
Lihat ini.

787
00:55:20,168 --> 00:55:22,754
Sudah selesai.
Tunggu sampai kau melihatnya.

788
00:55:29,970 --> 00:55:30,846
Selesai.

789
00:55:30,929 --> 00:55:31,888
Bagus!

790
00:55:31,972 --> 00:55:33,056
Ayo lihat.

791
00:55:48,029 --> 00:55:49,072
JANG MI-SOOK

792
00:55:52,492 --> 00:55:53,551
Apa dia sungguh tak bisa melihat?

793
00:55:53,576 --> 00:55:55,161
Kau lihat itu?

794
00:55:55,453 --> 00:55:58,999
Pria ini menakjubkan!

795
00:55:59,833 --> 00:56:02,210
Bagaimana cara dia mengukir
huruf seindah itu...

796
00:56:02,236 --> 00:56:03,487
...tanpa bisa melihat?

797
00:56:07,006 --> 00:56:08,341
Berikan kepadanya sebagai hadiah.

798
00:56:08,425 --> 00:56:09,592
Punyaku.

799
00:56:11,556 --> 00:56:13,641
Dia tak pura-pura
tak bisa melihat, bukan?

800
00:56:13,667 --> 00:56:14,835
Tidak.

801
00:56:15,849 --> 00:56:18,560
Bagaimana dia tahu...

802
00:56:18,643 --> 00:56:21,938
...hurufnya cantik atau tidak
tanpa melihatnya?

803
00:56:22,197 --> 00:56:24,148
Makanya dia sangat luar biasa!

804
00:56:24,836 --> 00:56:26,526
Tapi menakjubkannya stempel ini adalah,

805
00:56:26,552 --> 00:56:27,970
berikan.

806
00:56:29,176 --> 00:56:32,365
Jika kau gunakan ini di kontrak,

807
00:56:33,241 --> 00:56:34,158
kau takkan menghadapi masalah.

808
00:56:34,408 --> 00:56:35,493
Ini sempurna.

809
00:56:35,581 --> 00:56:36,647
- Benarkah?
- Tentu.

810
00:56:36,988 --> 00:56:39,115
Ini bukan stempel biasa.

811
00:56:39,846 --> 00:56:42,750
Ini punya kekuatan jimat.

812
00:56:44,352 --> 00:56:45,312
Kau mengarang itu...

813
00:56:45,461 --> 00:56:47,077
Jika kau mau stempel,

814
00:56:47,104 --> 00:56:49,564
selalu beli dari Young-gyu!

815
00:56:49,590 --> 00:56:51,217
Terima kasih.

816
00:56:51,797 --> 00:56:54,011
Yeong-gyu! Minumlah bir.

817
00:56:54,095 --> 00:56:55,888
Tunggu, aku akan
mengosongkan ini untukmu.

818
00:56:58,724 --> 00:57:01,269
Minum yang dingin.

819
00:57:01,757 --> 00:57:02,883
Aku akan menuangkannya...

820
00:57:03,242 --> 00:57:07,109
...karena kau cerdas dan menakjubkan.

821
00:57:07,316 --> 00:57:09,443
Oke, habiskan!

822
00:57:12,280 --> 00:57:13,322
Bagus.

823
00:57:14,615 --> 00:57:16,659
Bagus sekali.

824
00:57:16,826 --> 00:57:17,994
Bagus.

825
00:57:18,911 --> 00:57:20,788
Dia minum dengan sangat baik.

826
00:57:20,871 --> 00:57:23,366
Jangan memaksakan diri.
Kau akan tersedak!

827
00:57:23,392 --> 00:57:26,311
- Beri dia camilan juga.
- Ini, buka mulutmu.

828
00:57:26,337 --> 00:57:27,505
Buka!

829
00:57:30,005 --> 00:57:33,801
Pak Baek, kau pasti sukses...

830
00:57:34,135 --> 00:57:36,011
...berkat stempel pria ini.

831
00:57:36,095 --> 00:57:37,012
Sudah kubilang,

832
00:57:37,039 --> 00:57:39,040
karena stempel dia!

833
00:58:29,815 --> 00:58:31,275
Yeong-gyu.

834
00:58:32,270 --> 00:58:33,021
Ya, Pak?

835
00:58:33,694 --> 00:58:35,862
Kau sebaiknya ingat aku...

836
00:58:36,000 --> 00:58:39,283
...sebagai orang yang menolongmu.

837
00:58:42,327 --> 00:58:43,787
Tentu saja.

838
00:58:45,330 --> 00:58:50,335
Dasar bodoh...

839
00:58:53,557 --> 00:58:54,464
Bos.

840
00:58:54,870 --> 00:58:55,871
Ya?

841
00:58:56,378 --> 00:58:57,631
Apa ada masalah?

842
00:58:58,585 --> 00:58:59,285
Ya?

843
00:59:00,134 --> 00:59:05,225
Aku selalu berterima kasih padamu, Pak.

844
00:59:07,394 --> 00:59:08,353
Hei.

845
00:59:10,564 --> 00:59:14,025
Kau tahu istrimu menyusahkanku
belakangan ini?

846
00:59:16,528 --> 00:59:17,007
Apa?

847
00:59:18,905 --> 00:59:20,156
Kau menyuruhnya melakukan ini?

848
00:59:22,409 --> 00:59:26,454
Tidak! Tentu saja tidak!
Tak mungkin, Pak!

849
00:59:27,414 --> 00:59:31,960
Pak, aku akan menyuruhnya berhenti.

850
00:59:32,794 --> 00:59:34,587
Tolong jangan marah.

851
00:59:35,588 --> 00:59:37,590
Dasar tak berguna...

852
00:59:40,260 --> 00:59:42,804
Membunuh kalian...

853
00:59:43,721 --> 00:59:46,850
...lebih mudah daripada menurunkan...

854
00:59:46,933 --> 00:59:47,892
...celanaku di toilet.

855
00:59:47,976 --> 00:59:49,811
Ya, tentu saja.

856
00:59:49,894 --> 00:59:52,939
Dasar tak tahu terima kasih...

857
00:59:55,817 --> 00:59:56,573
Hei.

858
00:59:57,331 --> 00:59:57,944
Apa?

859
00:59:58,361 --> 01:00:00,572
Minumlah.

860
01:00:45,658 --> 01:00:46,367
Sayang.

861
01:00:48,974 --> 01:00:50,329
Kau sedang mengerjakan apa?

862
01:00:53,362 --> 01:00:56,002
Bukan apa-apa...

863
01:01:10,901 --> 01:01:13,519
Bagaimana caramu
mengatur para wanita ini...

864
01:01:13,545 --> 01:01:15,130
...sampai hal seperti ini terjadi?

865
01:01:17,773 --> 01:01:18,983
Pecat semua wanita itu.

866
01:01:19,448 --> 01:01:20,025
Apa?

867
01:01:20,818 --> 01:01:23,153
Keluar dan pecat semua wanita itu!

868
01:01:23,320 --> 01:01:24,238
Ya, Pak.

869
01:01:26,740 --> 01:01:28,492
Dasar tak berguna...

870
01:01:40,129 --> 01:01:42,089
Para wanita itu keterlaluan...

871
01:01:48,119 --> 01:01:50,431
Ini Baek dari Cheongpung.

872
01:01:50,971 --> 01:01:54,599
Aku dalam masalah besar di sini.

873
01:01:54,768 --> 01:01:58,209
Berapa banyak pria
yang bisa kau kumpulkan untukku?

874
01:02:14,992 --> 01:02:15,755
Siapa di sana?

875
01:02:21,690 --> 01:02:22,649
Ada orang di sana?

876
01:02:23,401 --> 01:02:25,382
Siapa kalian?

877
01:02:26,007 --> 01:02:27,634
Siapa kalian?

878
01:02:30,679 --> 01:02:31,972
Apa Pak Baek...

879
01:02:32,055 --> 01:02:34,015
...mengutus kalian?

880
01:02:39,563 --> 01:02:40,939
Ada apa?

881
01:02:45,110 --> 01:02:46,027
Sayang!

882
01:02:46,111 --> 01:02:47,946
Jangan lakukan ini!

883
01:02:50,198 --> 01:02:51,658
Tolong berhenti.

884
01:02:51,741 --> 01:02:53,410
Tolong jangan lakukan ini.
Lepaskan kami.

885
01:02:57,157 --> 01:02:58,540
Ampuni dia!

886
01:02:58,654 --> 01:03:01,423
Pak, maafkan aku! Kumohon!

887
01:03:01,671 --> 01:03:03,920
Aku takkan melakukannya lagi.

888
01:03:04,050 --> 01:03:05,484
Maafkan kami.

889
01:03:05,744 --> 01:03:09,915
Maafkan kami, tolong jangan!

890
01:03:10,096 --> 01:03:10,948
Pak!

891
01:03:11,522 --> 01:03:12,565
Cukup.

892
01:03:12,591 --> 01:03:14,493
Tolong ampuni kami...

893
01:03:15,323 --> 01:03:16,032
Ya ampun.

894
01:03:16,724 --> 01:03:18,726
Kalian pasti lapar, ayo cari makan.

895
01:03:25,984 --> 01:03:27,026
Sayang...

896
01:03:29,320 --> 01:03:30,363
Sayang?

897
01:03:46,587 --> 01:03:47,755
Tolong bantu.

898
01:03:50,842 --> 01:03:52,677
Ada orang di sana?

899
01:03:54,762 --> 01:03:56,514
Tolong!

900
01:03:57,014 --> 01:03:58,433
Tolong...

901
01:04:28,337 --> 01:04:30,330
Apa yang kau lakukan? Dasar gila!

902
01:04:30,356 --> 01:04:33,092
Apa salahku? Katakan!

903
01:04:33,688 --> 01:04:34,427
Astaga.

904
01:04:34,885 --> 01:04:36,554
Ada orang di luar?

905
01:04:36,637 --> 01:04:38,556
- Apa salahku?
- Ada orang di luar?

906
01:04:38,639 --> 01:04:39,557
Lepaskan aku!

907
01:04:39,916 --> 01:04:41,183
Sial...

908
01:04:45,396 --> 01:04:46,772
Wanita gila.

909
01:04:56,574 --> 01:05:00,953
Sepertinya orang-orang bodoh itu...

910
01:05:01,620 --> 01:05:06,458
...gagal, jadi kusuruh kembali.

911
01:05:08,252 --> 01:05:13,757
Aku bilang buat dia tak bisa
bangun selama beberapa hari.

912
01:05:25,346 --> 01:05:32,269
Mereka bilang pria tunanetra itu keluar.

913
01:06:00,554 --> 01:06:02,514
Bukankah itu aneh?

914
01:06:02,616 --> 01:06:05,911
Tak perlu membunuh dia.

915
01:06:54,774 --> 01:06:58,570
Tak ada yang melihat apa pun...

916
01:06:58,653 --> 01:06:59,946
Sadarlah...

917
01:07:05,027 --> 01:07:07,537
Si bodoh itu...

918
01:07:07,996 --> 01:07:11,624
...bahkan tak bisa menyingkirkan
jasadnya dengan benar,

919
01:07:12,500 --> 01:07:15,628
jadi orang-orangku mengurusnya,

920
01:07:16,363 --> 01:07:20,659
dan bahkan mengadakan
pemakaman untuknya.

921
01:07:23,355 --> 01:07:27,265
Kurasa mereka melakukannya
agar tak disalahkan.

922
01:07:33,187 --> 01:07:38,985
Mereka mungkin menguburnya
sangat dalam...

923
01:07:39,277 --> 01:07:45,241
...sampai si bodoh itu tak pernah
ketahuan atas pembunuhan itu.

924
01:07:54,959 --> 01:08:03,066
Dia seharusnya berterima kasih
pada kami.

925
01:08:03,092 --> 01:08:04,135
Tidak mungkin.

926
01:08:06,466 --> 01:08:07,638
Jangan bohong...

927
01:08:09,515 --> 01:08:10,808
Jangan bohong padaku.

928
01:08:12,393 --> 01:08:14,520
Dong-hwan, hentikan. Tolong jangan!

929
01:08:14,603 --> 01:08:17,106
Katakan yang sebenarnya.
Kau membunuhnya, bukan?

930
01:08:17,690 --> 01:08:19,900
Jangan lakukan ini!

931
01:08:19,984 --> 01:08:21,819
Dasar mesum!

932
01:08:21,902 --> 01:08:24,238
- Hentikan!
- Kau membunuhnya.

933
01:08:24,432 --> 01:08:27,059
Kau membunuhnya. Kau pelakunya!

934
01:08:28,492 --> 01:08:30,160
Ini bukan cara membereskan masalah!

935
01:08:30,244 --> 01:08:31,370
'Ini bukan caranya'?

936
01:08:37,126 --> 01:08:38,294
Serius?

937
01:09:26,508 --> 01:09:29,511
WAWANCARA KELIMA

938
01:10:03,128 --> 01:10:06,089
Ayah tak tahu kau sudah pulang.
Sunyi sekali.

939
01:10:08,617 --> 01:10:10,760
Apa yang kau lakukan belakangan ini?

940
01:10:13,304 --> 01:10:15,056
Tidurlah.

941
01:10:17,360 --> 01:10:18,268
Ayah.

942
01:10:18,682 --> 01:10:19,370
Ya?

943
01:10:22,480 --> 01:10:24,774
Aku bertemu pria
bernama Baek Joo-sang hari ini.

944
01:10:29,654 --> 01:10:30,488
Siapa?

945
01:10:33,123 --> 01:10:36,501
Dia mengatakan hal yang sangat aneh...

946
01:10:41,931 --> 01:10:43,668
Apa Ayah membunuh Ibu?

947
01:11:10,361 --> 01:11:11,529
Tapi, Ayah...

948
01:11:15,074 --> 01:11:16,356
Kenapa Ayah melakukannya?

949
01:11:19,745 --> 01:11:20,475
Kenapa?

950
01:11:27,420 --> 01:11:29,380
Dulu hidup sangat sulit.

951
01:11:33,217 --> 01:11:34,844
Sejak Ayah kecil,

952
01:11:35,396 --> 01:11:37,857
Ayah hanya ingat diejek dan dipukuli.

953
01:11:38,055 --> 01:11:39,348
Karena Ayah tak bisa melihat...

954
01:11:41,725 --> 01:11:43,936
Saat Ayah ingin belajar
mengukir stempel,

955
01:11:48,039 --> 01:11:49,123
Ayah dipukuli tanpa sebab,

956
01:11:49,150 --> 01:11:50,901
entah siapa pelakunya.

957
01:11:52,653 --> 01:11:55,072
Itu benar-benar menyiksa.

958
01:11:56,282 --> 01:11:58,659
Tapi Ayah menabung mati-matian...

959
01:11:59,034 --> 01:12:03,414
...sampai tidak makan, tidak belanja,

960
01:12:04,957 --> 01:12:06,250
dan berhasil...

961
01:12:09,086 --> 01:12:10,608
...membuka kios kecil.

962
01:12:13,590 --> 01:12:15,926
UKIRAN STEMPEL

963
01:12:15,952 --> 01:12:16,870
Ayah pikir.

964
01:12:18,880 --> 01:12:22,474
Ayah bisa menahan kesulitan
10 kali lipat dari sebelumnya.

965
01:12:25,246 --> 01:12:29,148
Ayo, senyum lebar!

966
01:12:29,690 --> 01:12:32,401
Kenapa kau ingin memotret
orang yang tak bisa melihat?

967
01:12:32,935 --> 01:12:34,752
Kau terlihat tampan saat senyum.

968
01:12:34,778 --> 01:12:35,863
Ayo, senyum!

969
01:12:36,572 --> 01:12:38,240
- Satu...
- Lihat ke sini?

970
01:12:38,323 --> 01:12:39,658
Ya, itu bagus.

971
01:12:39,741 --> 01:12:40,784
Baiklah, satu,

972
01:12:40,826 --> 01:12:41,785
dua,

973
01:12:41,868 --> 01:12:42,911
tiga!

974
01:12:43,704 --> 01:12:44,746
Bagus sekali.

975
01:12:48,431 --> 01:12:49,824
Wah...

976
01:12:51,030 --> 01:12:54,548
Kau hebat, melakukan ini
meskipun tak bisa melihat.

977
01:12:56,174 --> 01:12:57,050
Hei.

978
01:12:58,385 --> 01:13:01,722
Saat aku melihat orang sepertimu
bekerja sangat keras,

979
01:13:02,389 --> 01:13:04,975
luar biasa, aku sangat menghormati itu.

980
01:13:06,157 --> 01:13:10,147
Dengar, aku akan membingkai foto ini...

981
01:13:10,897 --> 01:13:13,817
...sebagai hadiah pembukaan.

982
01:13:13,986 --> 01:13:15,527
Gantung di tempat terbaik...

983
01:13:15,553 --> 01:13:16,471
...saat kau sukses, ya?

984
01:13:19,698 --> 01:13:20,907
- Pak?
- Ya?

985
01:13:22,370 --> 01:13:22,967
Aku...

986
01:13:23,827 --> 01:13:25,036
Terima kasih.

987
01:13:25,662 --> 01:13:27,038
- Aku akan bekerja keras.
- Bagus.

988
01:13:28,206 --> 01:13:30,583
- Ya, bekerja keraslah!
- Baik, Pak!

989
01:13:30,610 --> 01:13:32,393
- Kau harus sukses.
- Terima kasih!

990
01:13:32,419 --> 01:13:35,130
- Bagus, aku harus pergi.
- Baik, Pak!

991
01:13:36,485 --> 01:13:38,341
- Hati-hati, Bos.
- Dah.

992
01:13:39,426 --> 01:13:40,468
Astaga...

993
01:13:48,268 --> 01:13:49,978
Tapi semua tak berjalan lancar.

994
01:13:54,607 --> 01:13:57,360
Tak ada yang peduli pada pria
tunanetra yang mengukir stempel.

995
01:13:58,945 --> 01:14:00,530
Yang datang cuma orang penasaran...

996
01:14:00,613 --> 01:14:03,157
...atau orang yang cari gara-gara
untuk menguji kemampuan Ayah.

997
01:14:11,603 --> 01:14:13,376
Saat itulah Ayah bertemu ibumu.

998
01:14:21,801 --> 01:14:23,094
Hurufnya...

999
01:14:24,047 --> 01:14:25,528
...sangat cantik...

1000
01:14:26,973 --> 01:14:27,849
Cantik?

1001
01:14:30,017 --> 01:14:33,271
Kau mau stempel?

1002
01:14:33,563 --> 01:14:34,730
Tidak...

1003
01:14:36,440 --> 01:14:38,067
Aku mau saja...

1004
01:14:38,818 --> 01:14:44,699
Tapi saat ini
aku tak membutuhkan stempel.

1005
01:14:45,616 --> 01:14:46,852
Mungkin nanti...

1006
01:14:47,741 --> 01:14:49,787
Nanti, aku mau.

1007
01:14:49,933 --> 01:14:51,518
Tak apa.

1008
01:14:51,789 --> 01:14:53,249
Bagaimana kalau begini?

1009
01:14:54,166 --> 01:14:56,252
Kau pelanggan pertamaku...

1010
01:14:56,961 --> 01:14:59,338
...setelah membuka kios ini,

1011
01:15:02,550 --> 01:15:05,011
bagaimana jika kubuatkan secara gratis?

1012
01:15:07,138 --> 01:15:08,055
Benarkah?

1013
01:15:08,139 --> 01:15:09,348
Tentu.

1014
01:15:12,017 --> 01:15:13,060
Tunggu.

1015
01:15:14,019 --> 01:15:16,230
Siapa namamu?

1016
01:15:18,320 --> 01:15:19,733
Young-hee.

1017
01:15:19,817 --> 01:15:21,152
Young-hee.

1018
01:15:21,235 --> 01:15:22,987
Jung Young-hee.

1019
01:15:23,013 --> 01:15:24,681
Nona Jung Young-hee.

1020
01:15:24,707 --> 01:15:26,292
Saat itulah Ayah tahu namanya.

1021
01:15:27,908 --> 01:15:29,827
Jung Young-hee.

1022
01:15:33,747 --> 01:15:34,707
Nama yang indah.

1023
01:15:34,790 --> 01:15:37,209
Namamu sangat indah.

1024
01:15:39,420 --> 01:15:40,921
Karena kau pelanggan pertamaku,

1025
01:15:41,484 --> 01:15:43,278
aku akan membuatnya sangat spesial.

1026
01:15:46,885 --> 01:15:48,345
Baiklah.

1027
01:15:49,430 --> 01:15:53,183
Kau bekerja di pabrik di sini?

1028
01:15:54,306 --> 01:15:55,558
Ya.

1029
01:15:59,670 --> 01:16:01,859
Sebentar... Baiklah.

1030
01:16:03,694 --> 01:16:06,613
Sekarang, tekan sendiri.

1031
01:16:08,740 --> 01:16:09,950
Di sini.

1032
01:16:12,012 --> 01:16:16,517
Tempelkan ke bantalan tinta, lalu tekan.

1033
01:16:19,446 --> 01:16:21,962
Gerakkan ke atas dan bawah,

1034
01:16:22,045 --> 01:16:23,714
lalu ke kiri dan kanan.

1035
01:16:25,215 --> 01:16:26,299
Bagus.

1036
01:16:26,383 --> 01:16:29,219
JUNG YOUNG-HEE

1037
01:16:29,761 --> 01:16:30,887
Bagaimana?

1038
01:16:32,055 --> 01:16:33,932
Cantik sekali.

1039
01:16:34,455 --> 01:16:35,267
Benarkah?

1040
01:16:36,017 --> 01:16:39,521
Ambil kertas ini juga.

1041
01:16:40,857 --> 01:16:42,274
Jangan lupa beri tahu orang-orang.

1042
01:16:43,191 --> 01:16:44,359
Ya.

1043
01:16:47,320 --> 01:16:48,780
Setelah hari itu,

1044
01:16:49,691 --> 01:16:51,777
dia mampir, mengobrol dengan Ayah,

1045
01:16:53,201 --> 01:16:56,121
<i>dan membawakan Ayah
nasi kepal dan camilan.</i>

1046
01:16:57,157 --> 01:16:59,874
Kau belum makan siang, ya?

1047
01:17:00,292 --> 01:17:02,877
Ada lebihan...

1048
01:17:05,213 --> 01:17:06,339
Apa ini?

1049
01:17:07,257 --> 01:17:08,591
Cuma nasi kepal.

1050
01:17:10,176 --> 01:17:11,240
Kau tak perlu...

1051
01:17:12,773 --> 01:17:14,441
<i>Untuk kali pertama dalam hidup Ayah,</i>

1052
01:17:14,639 --> 01:17:17,016
<i>seseorang tertarik pada Ayah.</i>

1053
01:17:18,815 --> 01:17:22,063
Mendengar suara Young-hee...

1054
01:17:23,192 --> 01:17:24,610
...membuat jantung Ayah berdebar.

1055
01:17:25,158 --> 01:17:26,568
<i>Deg-deg.</i>

1056
01:17:26,651 --> 01:17:28,194
- Terima kasih.
- Ya.

1057
01:17:30,530 --> 01:17:32,448
- Terima kasih lagi!
- Oke...

1058
01:17:34,617 --> 01:17:37,203
Aku sangat iri, Yeong-gyu.

1059
01:17:37,229 --> 01:17:39,481
Lihat gadis cantik itu menaksirmu.

1060
01:17:39,622 --> 01:17:40,582
Benar.

1061
01:17:41,249 --> 01:17:42,667
Kau pasti menderita tak melihat...

1062
01:17:42,750 --> 01:17:45,795
...kecantikan sehebat itu.

1063
01:17:46,129 --> 01:17:47,230
Kau sebaiknya cepat menikahinya...

1064
01:17:47,255 --> 01:17:49,257
...sebelum keduluan.

1065
01:17:49,674 --> 01:17:50,691
Ajak dia hidup denganmu!

1066
01:17:50,717 --> 01:17:53,136
Jangan sampai dia pergi
dan menyesalinya.

1067
01:17:56,514 --> 01:17:57,515
Beruntung sekali.

1068
01:18:02,615 --> 01:18:04,021
Mendengar itu membuat Ayah gelisah,

1069
01:18:04,784 --> 01:18:08,234
dan Ayah menjadi takut.

1070
01:18:10,430 --> 01:18:12,718
Entah bagaimana,
Ayah memberanikan diri...

1071
01:18:13,739 --> 01:18:15,032
...untuk mengajaknya hidup dengan Ayah.

1072
01:18:16,200 --> 01:18:17,410
Ayah berjanji menjaganya.

1073
01:18:22,206 --> 01:18:26,919
Lalu ibumu mau.

1074
01:18:34,218 --> 01:18:35,261
Ayah sungguh tak bisa...

1075
01:18:35,747 --> 01:18:38,597
...percaya keberuntungan Ayah.

1076
01:18:39,932 --> 01:18:42,560
Ayo, beri tepuk tangan!

1077
01:18:49,441 --> 01:18:53,675
Apa keuntungan menikah?

1078
01:18:54,029 --> 01:18:55,823
Punya banyak anak, bukan?

1079
01:18:55,906 --> 01:18:58,075
Lihat pria ini menyeringai!

1080
01:18:59,618 --> 01:19:00,703
Kapan itu terjadi?

1081
01:19:00,786 --> 01:19:02,246
- Pada malam hari!
- Malam.

1082
01:19:02,329 --> 01:19:04,915
Hei, Yeong-gyu, kau sangat beruntung.

1083
01:19:05,062 --> 01:19:06,667
Buatmu selalu malam!

1084
01:19:10,421 --> 01:19:11,964
Karena ini pernikahan kalian,

1085
01:19:12,047 --> 01:19:14,383
aku akan memotret kalian.

1086
01:19:14,466 --> 01:19:16,343
- Berdiri tegak.
- Bagus.

1087
01:19:16,677 --> 01:19:17,720
Aku harus lihat ke mana?

1088
01:19:17,803 --> 01:19:19,513
Yeong-gyu, lihat ke sini.

1089
01:19:20,681 --> 01:19:22,015
Kita mulai, satu...

1090
01:19:22,042 --> 01:19:25,295
<i>Saat itulah Ayah membentuk
impian nyata pertama Ayah.</i>

1091
01:19:26,728 --> 01:19:31,254
<i>Untuk memastikan Young-hee
tak pernah dihina...</i>

1092
01:19:32,654 --> 01:19:34,573
<i>...dan bisa hidup terhormat.</i>

1093
01:19:36,166 --> 01:19:37,327
Ya ampun.

1094
01:19:37,524 --> 01:19:39,544
Baiklah, baiklah.

1095
01:19:40,617 --> 01:19:42,995
Apa kau lapar?

1096
01:19:49,163 --> 01:19:50,206
Aku kembali.

1097
01:19:50,232 --> 01:19:52,587
Dong-hwan pasti sangat lapar.

1098
01:19:56,019 --> 01:19:57,062
Ini.

1099
01:19:59,922 --> 01:20:01,263
<i>Setelah memilikimu,</i>

1100
01:20:02,264 --> 01:20:03,849
<i>kami sulit menabung...</i>

1101
01:20:03,993 --> 01:20:05,976
...meskipun kami berdua bekerja.

1102
01:20:09,771 --> 01:20:11,731
Tapi itu tidak buruk,

1103
01:20:12,899 --> 01:20:14,151
tidak buruk sama sekali.

1104
01:20:20,115 --> 01:20:21,449
Lalu suatu malam,

1105
01:20:23,243 --> 01:20:27,247
Gyu-Chil ada di dekat sana
untuk bekerja...

1106
01:20:27,273 --> 01:20:28,858
...dan mampir.

1107
01:20:35,547 --> 01:20:37,048
- Terima kasih, Bu.
- Ya.

1108
01:20:40,774 --> 01:20:41,318
Hei.

1109
01:20:41,344 --> 01:20:42,976
Ini, makanlah.

1110
01:20:43,002 --> 01:20:43,836
Oke.

1111
01:20:47,142 --> 01:20:49,644
Dia baik hati?

1112
01:20:49,811 --> 01:20:51,688
Ya, tentu saja.

1113
01:20:53,623 --> 01:20:54,446
Hei.

1114
01:20:55,504 --> 01:20:59,154
Pria tunanetra sepertiku bertemu
wanita sebaik itu...

1115
01:21:00,743 --> 01:21:02,411
...adalah suatu berkat!

1116
01:21:06,703 --> 01:21:09,664
Aku hanya menyesal
tak pernah melihat wajahnya...

1117
01:21:10,832 --> 01:21:11,916
...dengan mataku.

1118
01:21:13,585 --> 01:21:16,379
Yang penting hatinya baik.

1119
01:21:18,214 --> 01:21:21,634
Mungkin sebaiknya
kau tak pernah lihat wajahnya.

1120
01:21:22,885 --> 01:21:24,595
Dasar...

1121
01:21:25,388 --> 01:21:31,394
Aku hanya ingin melihat wajahnya
sekali saja.

1122
01:21:31,728 --> 01:21:33,688
Jangan bicara yang tidak-tidak.

1123
01:21:34,313 --> 01:21:35,731
Tidak, sungguh.

1124
01:21:36,315 --> 01:21:38,025
Kau sebaiknya tidak melihat dia.

1125
01:21:40,820 --> 01:21:42,071
Apa maksudmu?

1126
01:21:45,575 --> 01:21:47,702
Apa tak ada
yang mengatakan sesuatu padamu?

1127
01:21:47,785 --> 01:21:49,453
Soal wajahnya?

1128
01:21:50,705 --> 01:21:52,623
Dan dia...

1129
01:21:55,876 --> 01:21:57,712
...akhirnya mengatakannya.

1130
01:22:00,381 --> 01:22:01,716
Wajah ibumu...

1131
01:22:05,094 --> 01:22:09,348
...sangat jelek, seperti monster.

1132
01:22:16,516 --> 01:22:18,184
Saat itulah Ayah tahu semuanya.

1133
01:22:28,450 --> 01:22:29,410
Mereka,

1134
01:22:31,537 --> 01:22:36,208
orang-orang itu mengejek Ayah.

1135
01:22:39,378 --> 01:22:41,088
Mengejek Ayah sejak awal.

1136
01:23:00,107 --> 01:23:04,027
Sejak muda,
Ayah diejek dan diremehkan.

1137
01:23:06,815 --> 01:23:09,533
Ayah berusaha sangat keras
untuk lepas dari itu.

1138
01:23:11,744 --> 01:23:12,787
Tapi kemudian...

1139
01:23:13,829 --> 01:23:15,664
...itu terus terjadi.

1140
01:23:16,331 --> 01:23:17,437
Lagi dan lagi!

1141
01:23:22,921 --> 01:23:24,172
Monster...

1142
01:23:25,882 --> 01:23:26,800
Kenapa?

1143
01:23:28,218 --> 01:23:30,262
Kau kira Ayah tak tahu...

1144
01:23:31,086 --> 01:23:32,712
...apa itu cantik dan jelek?

1145
01:23:35,809 --> 01:23:38,228
Orang mungkin diam-diam
meremehkan Ayah,

1146
01:23:38,311 --> 01:23:40,147
tapi kenapa membungkuk
di hadapan Ayah?

1147
01:23:42,816 --> 01:23:46,111
Karena ukiran Ayah cantik.

1148
01:23:46,904 --> 01:23:48,176
Sangat cantik.

1149
01:23:50,115 --> 01:23:51,241
Ayah tahu itu.

1150
01:23:53,326 --> 01:23:56,371
Hal cantik dihormati dan dikagumi.

1151
01:23:58,206 --> 01:24:01,334
Hal jelek dihina.

1152
01:24:03,846 --> 01:24:04,838
Ayah tahu semuanya.

1153
01:24:15,015 --> 01:24:16,199
Saat itulah Ayah mulai melihat hal-hal...

1154
01:24:16,224 --> 01:24:17,830
...yang sebelumnya tidak Ayah sadari.

1155
01:24:20,562 --> 01:24:21,688
Semuanya.

1156
01:24:23,316 --> 01:24:24,276
Semuanya.

1157
01:24:37,495 --> 01:24:39,998
Pada akhirnya,
bahkan ibumu pun menipu Ayah.

1158
01:24:42,041 --> 01:24:44,168
Dia pasti sangat merendahkan Ayah.

1159
01:24:47,422 --> 01:24:51,676
Dia mendekati Ayah
hanya untuk mengejek Ayah.

1160
01:24:57,724 --> 01:24:59,517
Jika Ayah tetap bersamanya,

1161
01:25:00,727 --> 01:25:03,604
Ayah merasa tak pernah bisa
lari dari penghinaan.

1162
01:25:06,883 --> 01:25:09,343
Sekeras apa pun Ayah berusaha, gagal.

1163
01:25:10,611 --> 01:25:12,155
Ayah tak bisa hidup dengan wanita itu.

1164
01:25:17,886 --> 01:25:19,847
Bahkan saat dia bertengkar
dengan Pak Baek,

1165
01:25:21,497 --> 01:25:23,332
kenapa dia mempersulit hidup Ayah?

1166
01:25:24,667 --> 01:25:26,335
Ayah menyuruhnya berhenti,

1167
01:25:26,919 --> 01:25:28,462
tapi dia terus melakukannya
hanya untuk mengejek Ayah.

1168
01:25:35,580 --> 01:25:36,998
Tolong, mati saja.

1169
01:25:37,805 --> 01:25:40,933
Mati saja, mati...

1170
01:25:41,928 --> 01:25:44,061
Seseorang, tolong bunuh dia untukku.

1171
01:25:44,645 --> 01:25:45,771
Bunuh dia...

1172
01:25:50,985 --> 01:25:54,113
Sekeras apa pun Ayah berdoa,

1173
01:25:54,780 --> 01:25:57,032
dia tak pernah berniat
meninggalkan Ayah.

1174
01:25:58,200 --> 01:26:00,744
Bahkan setelah dipukuli,

1175
01:26:01,787 --> 01:26:03,122
dia terus kembali.

1176
01:26:13,876 --> 01:26:18,262
Ayah tak pernah membayangkan
akan membunuh dia.

1177
01:26:21,476 --> 01:26:22,516
Tak pernah terpikirkan.

1178
01:26:26,563 --> 01:26:27,521
Tak pernah.

1179
01:26:33,152 --> 01:26:34,799
Kau menemui Bos lagi?

1180
01:26:38,282 --> 01:26:38,824
Benar?

1181
01:26:42,160 --> 01:26:43,036
Benar?

1182
01:26:44,246 --> 01:26:45,664
Kau tahu...

1183
01:26:46,290 --> 01:26:47,165
Kenapa...

1184
01:26:50,047 --> 01:26:50,794
Kenapa?

1185
01:26:51,832 --> 01:26:55,590
Kenapa kau terus membuat masalah?

1186
01:27:03,265 --> 01:27:06,601
Apa salahku?

1187
01:27:06,685 --> 01:27:07,894
Astaga!

1188
01:27:12,441 --> 01:27:13,567
Sayang.

1189
01:27:15,069 --> 01:27:22,201
Tolong urus saja urusanmu sendiri!

1190
01:27:24,911 --> 01:27:29,165
Seperti tikus kecil,

1191
01:27:30,750 --> 01:27:36,798
hidup saja dengan tenang...

1192
01:27:47,517 --> 01:27:49,227
Sejak aku kecil,

1193
01:27:51,246 --> 01:27:53,832
orang selalu menyalahkanku.

1194
01:27:56,693 --> 01:27:57,777
Bahwa aku masalahnya.

1195
01:28:00,797 --> 01:28:04,092
Jadi, kupikir aku harus hidup...

1196
01:28:04,200 --> 01:28:06,369
...berpura-pura tak melihat
atau tahu apa pun.

1197
01:28:08,830 --> 01:28:13,960
Untuk sesaat, aku sangat berusaha
hidup seperti itu.

1198
01:28:16,421 --> 01:28:18,631
Tapi kau...

1199
01:28:20,014 --> 01:28:22,263
Kau baik padaku...

1200
01:28:22,289 --> 01:28:23,386
Hentikan.

1201
01:28:27,682 --> 01:28:29,434
Kau memberiku keberanian.

1202
01:28:33,238 --> 01:28:34,573
Karena kau.

1203
01:28:42,598 --> 01:28:43,515
Kau tidak...

1204
01:28:45,288 --> 01:28:46,634
Melihatku sebagai orang jelek...

1205
01:28:46,659 --> 01:28:47,785
Sial.

1206
01:28:51,181 --> 01:28:52,641
Diam!

1207
01:28:54,770 --> 01:28:56,502
Jika kau punya hati nurani,

1208
01:28:58,588 --> 01:29:00,006
kau takkan berani...

1209
01:29:00,089 --> 01:29:01,340
...mengatakan itu.

1210
01:30:05,195 --> 01:30:06,613
<i>Takkan ada yang tahu.</i>

1211
01:30:08,949 --> 01:30:12,744
Lagi pula, tak ada yang peduli.

1212
01:30:16,540 --> 01:30:17,749
Dong-hwan.

1213
01:30:20,168 --> 01:30:22,254
Dengan tangan Ayah sendiri,

1214
01:30:24,047 --> 01:30:29,386
Ayah singkirkan penghinaan
yang memaksa masuk ke hidup Ayah.

1215
01:30:30,679 --> 01:30:32,222
Tanpa ada yang tahu.

1216
01:31:35,952 --> 01:31:36,870
Dong-hwan.

1217
01:31:39,581 --> 01:31:40,874
Kau mengerti, bukan?

1218
01:31:46,838 --> 01:31:51,676
Jujur, ini semua demi dirimu juga.

1219
01:31:55,471 --> 01:31:57,807
Kau harus mengerti itu. Ya?

1220
01:31:58,266 --> 01:31:59,225
Kemarilah.

1221
01:31:59,976 --> 01:32:02,061
Nak, kemari.

1222
01:32:04,188 --> 01:32:06,899
Ayah hanya ingin menurunkan
hal-hal baik padamu.

1223
01:32:12,238 --> 01:32:14,407
Kau harus mengerti.

1224
01:32:14,884 --> 01:32:15,677
Kemarilah.

1225
01:32:15,867 --> 01:32:17,201
Aku tak mengerti Ayah.

1226
01:32:21,366 --> 01:32:22,534
Tidak.

1227
01:32:27,905 --> 01:32:29,364
Jika tidak,

1228
01:32:29,390 --> 01:32:31,007
kau hanya parasit.

1229
01:32:32,883 --> 01:32:33,467
Apa?

1230
01:32:34,844 --> 01:32:36,721
Parasit yang hidup...

1231
01:32:36,804 --> 01:32:38,681
...dari kerja keras Ayah seumur hidup.

1232
01:32:41,585 --> 01:32:42,685
Kau pasti mengerti.

1233
01:32:55,614 --> 01:32:57,283
Ayah pembunuh.

1234
01:33:00,744 --> 01:33:05,291
Tidak! Siapa yang pembunuh?
Tidak! Bukan Ayah!

1235
01:33:07,239 --> 01:33:09,658
Batas penuntutannya sudah berakhir!

1236
01:33:10,588 --> 01:33:12,214
Kau pikir Ayah tak tahu itu?

1237
01:33:16,218 --> 01:33:20,285
Ayah keajaiban hidup di Korea!

1238
01:33:23,809 --> 01:33:25,936
Pria yang melihat dunia lewat jarinya.

1239
01:33:29,022 --> 01:33:30,607
Keajaiban hidup...

1240
01:33:31,608 --> 01:33:33,193
Ayah bukan pembunuh.

1241
01:33:38,740 --> 01:33:41,743
PERNYATAAN TERAKHIR

1242
01:34:18,289 --> 01:34:20,782
Kau sangat mengagumi ayahmu,

1243
01:34:23,852 --> 01:34:26,813
kau yakin soal ini?

1244
01:34:30,343 --> 01:34:35,338
Aku sudah menghapus
bagian tak penting.

1245
01:34:36,692 --> 01:34:37,463
Apa?

1246
01:34:38,209 --> 01:34:44,849
Tolong pastikan
hasil dokumenternya bagus.

1247
01:34:48,019 --> 01:34:50,062
Kau tahu, ayahku...

1248
01:34:52,355 --> 01:34:54,441
Dia keajaiban hidup di Korea...

1249
01:34:54,733 --> 01:34:55,792
...karena mengatasi kesulitan sebesar itu.

1250
01:34:55,817 --> 01:34:56,985
Jadi, tolong...

1251
01:35:00,998 --> 01:35:02,500
Aku mengandalkanmu.

1252
01:35:16,546 --> 01:35:17,589
Kau mirip dia.

1253
01:35:20,251 --> 01:35:20,980
Apa?

1254
01:35:22,279 --> 01:35:23,551
Ayahmu.

1255
01:35:26,180 --> 01:35:28,266
Kau bahkan lebih mirip dia hari ini.

1256
01:35:34,099 --> 01:35:35,037
Aku...

1257
01:35:36,399 --> 01:35:38,734
...bicara lebih banyak
dengan Baek Joo-sang kemarin.

1258
01:35:40,361 --> 01:35:43,614
Semua ini karyaku.

1259
01:35:45,241 --> 01:35:47,743
Ini karya seni.

1260
01:35:53,499 --> 01:35:55,668
Kenapa kau tak memotret
Jung Young-hee?

1261
01:35:58,504 --> 01:36:01,340
Ada satu.

1262
01:36:03,012 --> 01:36:05,428
Aku mengambil foto kartu identitas...

1263
01:36:05,645 --> 01:36:10,975
...semua pegawai baru.

1264
01:36:22,811 --> 01:36:26,314
Eun-sook, senyum lebar!

1265
01:36:26,740 --> 01:36:28,367
Pegang, lebih tinggi.

1266
01:36:28,450 --> 01:36:29,994
Ya, dekatkan ke dada lagi.

1267
01:36:30,077 --> 01:36:31,912
Cantik sekali, bagus.

1268
01:36:32,121 --> 01:36:34,123
Oke, senyum, satu,

1269
01:36:34,206 --> 01:36:35,332
dua,

1270
01:36:36,250 --> 01:36:36,959
tiga!

1271
01:36:37,251 --> 01:36:38,127
JUNG YOUNG-HEE

1272
01:36:38,153 --> 01:36:39,633
Cantik sekali.

1273
01:36:40,170 --> 01:36:41,213
Selesai, pergilah.

1274
01:36:42,024 --> 01:36:43,234
Berikutnya.

1275
01:36:52,476 --> 01:36:54,560
Hei, Jung Young-hee.

1276
01:36:55,144 --> 01:36:58,147
Kenapa rambutmu diurai
untuk foto kartu identitas?

1277
01:36:59,231 --> 01:37:02,192
Ikat agar wajahmu lebih terlihat.

1278
01:37:06,864 --> 01:37:08,949
Baiklah, ini dia.

1279
01:37:10,562 --> 01:37:12,105
Senyum.

1280
01:37:12,312 --> 01:37:13,313
Senyum lebar.

1281
01:37:14,667 --> 01:37:15,914
Satu,

1282
01:37:16,258 --> 01:37:17,447
dua,

1283
01:37:17,791 --> 01:37:18,834
tiga!

1284
01:37:24,339 --> 01:37:25,841
Ini foto ibumu.

1285
01:37:29,070 --> 01:37:30,152
Itu pun...

1286
01:37:30,178 --> 01:37:31,221
...jika kau masih tertarik.

1287
01:39:23,416 --> 01:39:26,043
PARK JEONG MIN

1288
01:39:28,212 --> 01:39:30,673
KWON HAE-HYO

1289
01:39:32,592 --> 01:39:35,344
HAN JI HYEON    IM SEONG JAE

1290
01:39:36,971 --> 01:39:39,598
DAN SHIN HYUN-BEEN

1291
01:39:41,475 --> 01:39:44,270
DISUTRADARAI OLEH YEON SANG-HO